Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.40,0:00:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,《星河战队》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.75,0:00:40.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全世界的青年男女{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Young people from all over the globe...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.66,0:00:42.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为全人类的未来奋战{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}are joining up to fight for the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.83,0:00:45.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我要出力 - 我要出力{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm doing my part. - I'm doing my part.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.75,0:00:49.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我要出力 - 我也要出力{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm doing my part. - I'm doing my part too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.30,0:00:53.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们全在出力 你呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're doing their part, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.55,0:00:56.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加入机动部队 拯救世界{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Join the Mobile Infantry and save the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.14,0:00:58.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,入伍就能获得公民权{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Service guarantees citizenship.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.67,0:01:00.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(你想知道更多吗?)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.93,0:01:01.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(虫族陨石)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.56,0:01:05.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虫族陨石再度侵犯地球{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The bugs send another meteor our way...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.69,0:01:07.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这次我们有所准备{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but this time we're ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.57,0:01:11.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地球的防卫日益精良{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Planetary defences are better than ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.08,0:01:15.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(你想知道更多吗?)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.66,0:01:18.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虫族陨石来自克兰达夫星球{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Klendathu, source of the bug meteor attacks...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.33,0:01:21.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,环绕着双子星系统运行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}orbits a twin star system whose brutal gravitational forces...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.83,0:01:24.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,附近的带状行星群带来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}produce an unlimited supply of bug meteorites...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.96,0:01:27.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大量的虫族陨石{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in the form of this asteroid belt.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.67,0:01:29.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为了捍卫太阳系{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To ensure the safety of our solar system...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.01,0:01:32.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,必须消灭克兰达夫星球{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Klendathu must be eliminated.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.01,0:01:36.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在从克兰达夫星球现场{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We break net now and take you live to Klendathu...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.85,0:01:39.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,转播这场大战{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}where the invasion has begun.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.68,0:01:43.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卫星连线 2...1...开始{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}EXQ uplink on two, one. You're on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.19,0:01:45.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我们刚降落在... - 快 快 快!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We'vejust landed here on what cap troopers... - Move, move, move!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.85,0:01:47.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 被称为大K星的战场 - 快! 走! 走!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- are calling Big K, - Come on! Move, move!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.02,0:01:50.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 第六机动部队正展开攻击 - 快!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- with the 6th Mobile Infantry Division! - Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.69,0:01:53.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这丑陋的星球全是大虫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's an ugly planet, a bug planet!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.03,0:01:56.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,威胁人类的生存{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A planet hostile to life as we know it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.20,0:02:01.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救命啊!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.63,0:02:15.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 快走 快 快 - 快!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come on! Go, go, go! - Keep moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.51,0:02:17.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快离开这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get out of here now!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.52,0:02:28.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,基顿 不!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kitten, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.05,0:02:51.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(一年前)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.38,0:03:02.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瑞哥...瑞哥...瑞哥!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rico. Rico. Rico!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.52,0:03:07.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,专心点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pay attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.23,0:03:10.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起 瑞斯加科先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry, Mr Rasczak.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.27,0:03:12.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总而言之{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's sum up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.40,0:03:15.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今年我们谈过民主制度失败的原因{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This year we explored the failure of democracy...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.28,0:03:17.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 坏家伙 - 社会学家...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Bad boy. - how the social scientists brought our world...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.15,0:03:18.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让世界陷入混乱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to the brink of chaos.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.07,0:03:21.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们谈到退伍军人终于接管统治...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We talked about the veterans, how they took control...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.91,0:03:26.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,长久以来使得地球得以安定{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and imposed the stability that has lasted for generations since.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.29,0:03:28.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些是事实让你们学到了什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know these facts...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.17,0:03:30.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我问你为何只有公民才能投票?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but have I taught you anything of value this year?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.21,0:03:34.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你 为什么只有公民才有投票权?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You. Why are only citizens allowed to vote?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.25,0:03:35.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是一种奖赏{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a reward,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.84,0:03:38.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是为联邦政府服务得到的奖励{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}what the Federation gives you for doing Federal Service.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.68,0:03:40.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不对 不对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.93,0:03:44.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,赐与的权利没有价值{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something given has no value.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.51,0:03:47.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,投票权是政治权{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, when you vote, you are exercising political authority.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.89,0:03:51.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就是力量 力量就是暴力{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're using force. And force, my friends, is violence,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.94,0:03:55.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,暴力是所有权力的来源{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the supreme authority from which all other authority is derived.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.86,0:03:58.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我妈妈说暴力解决不了问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, my mother always said violence never solves anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.03,0:04:00.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.61,0:04:04.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我真好奇广岛之父会不会这么说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wonder what the city fathers of Hiroshima would say about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.16,0:04:05.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.08,0:04:09.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大概不会这么说 因为广岛被炸了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They probably wouldn't say anything. Hiroshima was destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.04,0:04:11.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.46,0:04:13.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,历史证明赤裸裸的...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Naked force has resolved more issues...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.71,0:04:16.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,暴力解决许多问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}throughout history than any other factor.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.34,0:04:19.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,暴力解决不了问题的论调...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The contrary opinion, that violence never solves anything,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.88,0:04:22.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...只是自欺欺人的想法{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is wishful thinking at its worst.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.26,0:04:25.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,忘记历史教训的人将付出代价{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}People who forget that always pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.51,0:04:29.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瑞哥 在道德上...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rico, what's the moral difference, if any...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.18,0:04:31.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,公民和平民有何不同?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}between a civilian and a citizen?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.23,0:04:34.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,公民接受政府赋与的责任...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A citizen accepts personal responsibility for the safety...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.36,0:04:37.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,并且誓死捍卫地球{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of the body politic, defending it with his life.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.73,0:04:41.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 平民则不然 - 标准答案{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- A civilian does not. - The exact words of the text.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.91,0:04:44.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是你了解吗? 你相信吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But do you understand it? Do you believe it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.99,0:04:48.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 不知道 - 那是当然的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I don't know. - Of course you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.04,0:04:51.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算是死到临头{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I doubt anyone here would recognize civic virtue...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.21,0:04:53.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们都不了解公民的责任 第三节下课 第四节五分钟后上课{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if it reached up and bit you in the ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.10,0:05:12.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别在这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.98,0:05:15.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧 咱们去看数学课的成绩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, let's see if they posted the math final.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.19,0:05:18.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 瑞哥 赢得了泰斯拉队吗? - 我们会痛宰他们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Rico, we gonna take Tesla? - We're gonna kill 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.36,0:05:24.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,记住 毕业生都得填写710表格{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember, all graduating seniors must fill out a 710 form.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.20,0:05:26.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,星舰军校最重视数学成绩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}First thing Fleet Academy looks at is your math scores.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.70,0:05:28.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,祝我好运{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wish me luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.25,0:05:35.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(艾邦妮兹 数学97%)
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.46,0:05:38.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 要走了 - 干得好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Way to go. - Good job.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.55,0:05:40.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该你了 等一下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your turn. Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.84,0:05:43.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我去找马可 他姐姐在星际舰队{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want to talk to Marco. His sister's at Fleet.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.51,0:05:45.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 马可 - 嗨 卡门{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Marco. - Hi, Carmen.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.43,0:05:47.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你姐有消息吗? - 她当上飞行员{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What do you hear about Roxy? - She made pilot.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.53,0:05:51.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(瑞哥 数学35%)
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.06,0:05:53.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,35% 真棒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thirty-five percent. Very nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.31,0:05:59.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大伙看 35%{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at that. Thirty-five percent, ladies and gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.07,0:06:01.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,分数真高{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Big numbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.44,0:06:03.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 卡尔 - 抱歉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Carl. - Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.29,0:06:12.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们还没上床吧 别骗我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, you haven't done it yet, have you? Don't lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.95,0:06:14.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我并不急{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not in any hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.08,0:06:17.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 有人在等你 - 那么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Others are waiting. - And?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.38,0:06:21.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你能猜到她在想什么? - 不必猜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Did you read her mind? - Don't have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.25,0:06:23.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她在想什么很明显{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's pretty clear what she wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.59,0:06:26.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是呀 我要的是卡门{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, but I want Carmen.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.09,0:06:28.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你想得要死 - 再见 马可{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Aw, you got it bad. - Bye, Marco.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.35,0:06:29.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别忘了下午的事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, don't forget about this afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.81,0:06:32.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他老是为了亲你芳泽耽误正事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's always late when he walks you home to fish for a kiss.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.52,0:06:34.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快走开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.60,0:06:37.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 马可的姐姐当上飞行员 - 你也会的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Marco's sister made pilot. - So will you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.90,0:06:42.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想想看 如果要驾驶五十万吨重的星际战舰{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, imagine flying a half a million tons of starship.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.11,0:06:43.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就得勇气十足{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gotta have nerves of steel.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.82,0:06:46.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然 你有没有种呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, you do. Let's see how yours hold up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.45,0:06:47.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开始吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You may begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.88,0:07:01.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这只是一只虫 戴上护镜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aw, come on, it's just a bug. You better put your goggles on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.80,0:07:03.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是一只虫?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Just a bug."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.34,0:07:07.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人类自以为是大自然主宰者{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We humans like to think we are nature's finest achievement.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.47,0:07:09.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实并不然{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm afraid it just isn't true.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.80,0:07:14.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这只甲虫远比人类优良{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This Arkellian sand beetle is superior in many ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.35,0:07:19.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它的繁殖力很强 没有私心...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It reproduces in vast numbers, has no ego...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.15,0:07:23.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不会恐惧 绝不怕死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}has no fear, doesn't now about death...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.28,0:07:27.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它是虫族社会完美的一份子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and so is the perfect selfless member of society.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.24,0:07:29.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人类创造了艺术数学...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But humans have created art, mathematics...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.82,0:07:32.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和星际旅行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and interstellar travel.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.53,0:07:35.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错 不过千万别自大{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}True. But before you let that go to your head...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.62,0:07:37.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就拿阿瑞克尼虫族来说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}take the example of the Arachnids...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.04,0:07:41.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是高度进化的社会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a highly evolved insect society.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.38,0:07:44.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以人类的标准来说它们的智慧很低{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By human standards, they are relatively stupid...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.46,0:07:48.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它们却有数百万年的进化史{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but their evolution stretches over millions of years...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.80,0:07:51.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 现在 - 这儿 拿着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- and now... - Here, take this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.18,0:07:53.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它们能够把胚种{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they can colonize planets...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.68,0:07:56.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,送入太空占领别的星球{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}by hurling their spore into space.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.68,0:07:58.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,应该找到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, I think we got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.02,0:08:00.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是心脏{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's the heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.02,0:08:03.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是胃囊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And here's the stomach.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.61,0:08:11.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这算勇气十足?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nerves of steel, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.20,0:08:15.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(不符合)
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.55,0:08:18.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别费力去想 凭你的直觉想像画面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't think about it. Just go on instinct.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.42,0:08:20.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,试着将它形象化{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Try to visualize it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.65,0:08:37.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看到黑桃A{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see the ace of spades.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.49,0:08:42.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,统计学上的概率{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, statistically speaking,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.82,0:08:45.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道就算瞎猜 到现在也该猜中了吧! !{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you should have accidentally guessed right by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.74,0:08:50.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 再试一次 - 我不会心灵感应 而且运气也很背{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Try another. - So my psychic abilities are zero and I'm unlucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.66,0:08:52.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这跟运气无关{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, luck's not a factor.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.79,0:08:55.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有些人就是特别灵敏{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one really knows why some people are sensitive and some aren't.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.75,0:08:58.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁知道? 也许这是人类下一步的进化{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who knows? Maybe it's a new stage of human evolution.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.96,0:09:01.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以才有这种研究{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's why they do these kind of Federal studies.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.88,0:09:04.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,西哈诺 该死 暂停{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What... Cyrano... Oh, shit. Time out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.01,0:09:06.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它只是不甘寂寞{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, he just wants some attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.47,0:09:08.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你从不陪它玩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't play with him any more.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.18,0:09:09.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,西哈诺...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cyrano.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.81,0:09:14.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去烦我老妈去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go bug Mom, Cyrano.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.20,0:09:26.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是怎么做的?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do you make him do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.32,0:09:29.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我让它觉得我妈脚上有食物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, I gave him the impression there's a grub crawling up my mom's leg.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.83,0:09:31.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它非吃到不可{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's on a mission to go eat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.66,0:09:37.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,滚开 别碰我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ow! Oh! Get out! Get off my leg! Oh! Carl!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.42,0:09:41.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你最好别在我身上用心灵感应这招{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I sure hope you don't do anything like that to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.59,0:09:46.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别怕 对人类我没辙...暂时不行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't be afraid. Can't do human. Yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.64,0:09:48.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.14,0:09:55.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.03,0:10:05.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 好啊! - 老虎队得分{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah! Yeah! - Touchdown Tigers.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.91,0:10:08.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在的比数是41比38{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the score is now 41-38.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.41,0:10:10.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老虎队领先 只胜两局{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tigers lead with 2.:46 remaining...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.58,0:10:12.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里是布宜诺斯艾利斯球场{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}here at the Buenos Aires Sports Arena.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.83,0:10:14.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巨人队喊暂停{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Time out Giants.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.33,0:10:17.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你还好吧? - 好多了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Are you all right? - Much better.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.04,0:10:19.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 现在 - 好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Now. - Good.Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.50,0:10:22.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 上啊!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right! Way to go, team!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.17,0:10:23.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗨 你的头盔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey! Your helmet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.80,0:10:27.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,球赛后你要干嘛?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, what are you doing after the game?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.51,0:10:32.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都要参加舞会 你去吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, everyone's going to the dance, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.43,0:10:35.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不清楚 今晚是我当平民的最后一夜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know. It's my last night as a civilian.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.10,0:10:37.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 上 12号! 冲! - 明天我就要去特雷斯卡瓦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come on, number 12! Let's go! - Ship out for Tereshkova tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.77,0:10:41.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你要去星舰军校? - 嗯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You're going to the Fleet Academy? - Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.57,0:10:42.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也想去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's where I want to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.03,0:10:45.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,十二号 上场了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, number 12! Let's play ball!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.74,0:10:47.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别打我女友的主意{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't get any ideas about my girlfriend!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.37,0:10:54.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,情场如战场{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All is fair in love and war.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.41,0:10:57.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 巨人队! 巨人队! - 强尼 加油{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Giants! Giants! - Johnny! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.22,0:11:12.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿 好啊!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.93,0:11:16.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巨人队以43分领先 离终场只剩4秒钟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Giants leading 43-41. Just over 42 seconds remaining.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.52,0:11:21.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.90,0:11:23.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾文 拉森 挡住攻击{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Irvin, Lathom, cover the rush.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.90,0:11:26.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,派瑞做假动作 勃迪跑远点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perry, fake left. Bertolli, you go long.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.99,0:11:31.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瑞哥 翻跳动作 懂吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rico, flip six three hole. Got it? Hey, Rico?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.45,0:11:33.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 嘿! - 什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey! - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.91,0:11:37.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,专心点 翻跳动作 懂吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're drifting! Flip six, three hole, on one! Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.58,0:11:40.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 尽管把球传给我 蒂丝 - 准备好了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Just throw me the ball, Diz. - Ready? Break!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.98,0:12:04.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好! 走 走!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah! Go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.15,0:12:08.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.28,0:12:13.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,耶!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.62,0:12:16.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得分了 比赛结束{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's in there. It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.22,0:12:34.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你一下子就长这么大了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who said you could grow up so fast, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.60,0:12:36.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈 别这样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mom, don't get mushy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.60,0:12:40.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是今天寄来的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This came for you today.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.69,0:12:42.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是你要的吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I presume, at your request.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.32,0:12:48.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有很多朋友都要服役{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A lot of my friends are doing Federal Service.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.53,0:12:50.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不是想报名入伍吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, you're not thinking of applying?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.07,0:12:53.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你疯啦?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you lost your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.20,0:12:56.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就算是要挨鞭刑也不准你去自毁前程{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd rather take ten lashes in Public Square than see you ruin your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.49,0:12:58.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是志愿服役{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a term of service.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.83,0:13:00.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是从军{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not a career.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.83,0:13:02.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只想一个人出去...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just want to get out on my own...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.50,0:13:06.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,见识一下银河系风光{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}see the galaxy for a couple years.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.00,0:13:09.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,强尼 当兵会死人的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Johnny, people get killed in the Federal Service.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.51,0:13:13.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是谁把你说动的? 是那个老师 对吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who gave you this idea? It's that teacher, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.30,0:13:16.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他叫什么? 你应该知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's his name? You know the one I'm talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.35,0:13:20.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 瑞斯加科先生 - 瑞斯加科?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Mr Rasczak. - Rasczak?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.52,0:13:24.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这名字真可笑 法律应该...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Silly name. There should be a law against...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.86,0:13:27.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,禁止学校召募新兵{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}using a school as a recruiting station.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.11,0:13:31.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瑞斯加科不会这么做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, Rasczak doesn't do that at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.57,0:13:33.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实他反对学生从军{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He sort of discourages you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.74,0:13:35.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, that's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.62,0:13:38.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你得上哈佛 没什么好说的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}'Cause you're going to Harvard, and that's the end of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.74,0:13:41.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是我的决定 不是你的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's my decision, not yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.33,0:13:43.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 是这样吗? - 别吵了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh, is that how it is, huh? - Wait, you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.04,0:13:47.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我和你父亲要给你个惊喜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, Dad and I have a surprise for you that will settle this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.59,0:13:50.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你猜得到吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you guess what it is?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.13,0:13:51.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,猜不到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.63,0:13:54.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想见识银河系风光{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wanted to see the galaxy?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.64,0:13:58.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到土星外环旅行如何?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How about a trip to the Outer Rings?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.72,0:14:01.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,西格玛海滩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Zegema Beach. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.19,0:14:05.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一直想去那儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've always wanted to go there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.85,0:14:08.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好 就这么说定了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good, good. Then it's all settled.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.42,0:14:27.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别走开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sure. Don't go away.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.83,0:14:29.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想找瑞斯加科先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm just gonna go see Mr Rasczak.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.80,0:14:33.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瑞哥 想跳舞吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Rico, do you want to dance?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.92,0:14:35.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蒂丝 我答应卡门{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Actually, Diz, I promised Carmen...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.59,0:14:37.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真可惜 她不在{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aw, come on. Too bad for her if she's not around.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.31,0:14:44.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,过了今晚...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, it's sad. After tonight, most of us...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.14,0:14:46.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们恐怕不会再见面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}probably won't see each other again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.65,0:14:51.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要替巴西队打球吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, you still gonna play for Rio?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.74,0:14:56.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是呀 除非东京队要征召我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, looks like. Unless Tokyo lets me start.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.28,0:14:58.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁抢到你就走运{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, anyone who gets you is lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.91,0:15:02.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们怎么没成为一对?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Johnny, how come we never got together?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.58,0:15:08.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们不能只当朋友吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can't we just be friends, Diz?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.25,0:15:12.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.34,0:15:18.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 - 晚上好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Thank you. - Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.34,0:15:22.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蒂丝 我想找瑞斯加科先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, Diz, I want to talk to Mr Rasczak.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.47,0:15:26.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你最好赶快去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, you better hurry up if you want to catch him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.98,0:15:28.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你对我最好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.49,0:15:43.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瑞斯加科先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr Rasczak!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.16,0:15:46.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 什么事? 瑞哥 - 我要谢谢你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What is it, Rico? - I want to thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.20,0:15:48.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我最喜欢你的课{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your class was the best one I had this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.87,0:15:51.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只希望你能有所收获{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, it's really not my job to please. I just hope you learned something.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.54,0:15:53.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想入伍{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I want to join up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.38,0:15:55.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得我有成为公民的勇气{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think I got what it takes to be a citizen.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.38,0:15:57.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好 去试吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good for you. Go find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.84,0:15:59.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是我的决定我父母却反对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, my parents are against it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.84,0:16:01.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道这是我的选择{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I know it's my choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.51,0:16:03.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在想...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was wondering...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.39,0:16:04.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你若是我 你会怎么做?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}what would you do if you were me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.85,0:16:07.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能决定自己的前程{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Figuring things out for yourself...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.23,0:16:09.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才是真正的自由{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is the only freedom anyone really has.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.56,0:16:10.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,珍惜这自由{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Use that freedom.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.06,0:16:13.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自己决定吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make up your own mind, Rico.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.05,0:16:36.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别乱讲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't exaggerate.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.71,0:16:39.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是真的 你的眼睛好美{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm serious. I think you have really beautiful eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.80,0:16:41.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你了解? - 强尼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You know? - Johnny.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.22,0:16:46.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是山德{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, this is Zander.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.56,0:16:49.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们在球场上较过劲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, we know each other from the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.39,0:16:54.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你不介意吧? - 不介意 我们赢了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No hard feelings? - No, none at all. We won.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.40,0:16:58.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧 卡门 最后一支舞{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Carmen. It's the last dance.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.24,0:17:00.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许我在军校会见到你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, maybe I'll see you at the Academy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.32,0:17:01.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊 也许会吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.91,0:17:08.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 祝你好运 - 山德也要当飞行员{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Good luck. - Zander's going for pilot too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.91,0:17:12.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们真是绝配 卡门{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You two have so much in common.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.42,0:17:15.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,强尼·瑞哥 你在吃醋吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Johnny Rico, are you jealous?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.59,0:17:18.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.34,0:17:20.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不必吃醋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't have to be jealous.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.85,0:17:26.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗨 嗨...快分开 你们两个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, hey, break it up, you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.51,0:17:29.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要亲热就到别的地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a place for that sort of thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.02,0:17:35.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我考虑好了 我要入伍{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been thinking, and I'm gonna do it, Carmen.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.86,0:17:37.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要加入联邦军队{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna go for Federal Service.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.82,0:17:40.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.19,0:17:43.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我和卡尔明天登记 和我们一起去吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Carl and I are signing up tomorrow. Come with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.20,0:17:44.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.37,0:17:53.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我父亲今晚不在家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My father's not home tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.98,0:18:17.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我了解从军的...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I do now, of my own free will...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.65,0:18:21.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,意义和义务{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}after having been duly advised and warned...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.15,0:18:24.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这一切完全出于自愿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of the meaning and consequences of this oath...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.49,0:18:26.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我至少{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}enrol in the Federal Service...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.82,0:18:29.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,必须服役两年{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for not less than two years...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.16,0:18:32.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,若是有需要...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and as much longer as may be required...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.33,0:18:34.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我愿继续效忠部队{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}by the needs of the Federation.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.62,0:18:37.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 完了? - 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- All set? - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.88,0:18:44.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又来一批新兵{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fresh meat for the grinder, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.09,0:18:49.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你们的成绩如何? - 我要当飞行员{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- So, how'd you kids do? - I'm gonna be a pilot.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.01,0:18:54.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好 我们很需要飞行员{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, good for you. We need all the pilots we can get.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.77,0:18:58.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你被分派到研发部门吗? - 没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey, did you get starside R and D? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.73,0:19:02.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 不是吧? - 我要到战略理论部{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I don't believe it. - I got Games and Theory.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.32,0:19:04.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,战略理论?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Games and Theory?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.44,0:19:06.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 那是军事情报部 - 嗯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's military intelligence. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.07,0:19:09.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好家伙 卡尔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Way to go, Carl.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.45,0:19:12.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下次见面我就得向你敬礼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Next time we meet, I'll probably have to salute you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.24,0:19:13.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.08,0:19:16.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你呢 孩子?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How about you, son?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.08,0:19:20.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 机动部队 长官 - 很好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Infantry, sir. - Good for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.09,0:19:22.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,机动部队让我成为现在这样的男子汉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mobile Infantry made me the man I am today.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.34,0:19:28.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,新兵必须在二十四小时内...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All recruits must report to the Federal Transportation Hub...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.09,0:19:29.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到联邦运送站报到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}within 24 hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.80,0:19:32.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欢迎加入联邦军队的行列{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome to the adventure of Federal Service.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.51,0:19:34.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咱们一起发誓{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's make a vow.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.89,0:19:38.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管怎样 我们永远是朋友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No matter what, we'll always be friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.06,0:19:41.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我同意{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll go for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.94,0:19:45.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们恐怕不会再见面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, chances are we'll never see each other again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.03,0:19:50.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,分隔几百万光年的距离{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll be millions of light-years away from each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.20,0:19:52.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过 好呀 有何不可?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But, uh, yeah, sure. Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.25,0:19:57.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你给我去办退役{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll resign, and that's all there is to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.25,0:20:00.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然很没面子 不过也只能这样了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It may look bad, but if that's the worst you suffer, then that's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.21,0:20:03.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我不要退役 - 你一定要{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I won't quit! - I'm telling you, you will.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.21,0:20:05.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不能入伍 你要去渡假{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not going back. You're going on vacation!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.38,0:20:07.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不去渡假{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am not going on vacation!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.38,0:20:09.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要当公民{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want to be a citizen.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.26,0:20:10.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是我的决定{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's my decision. I made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.80,0:20:12.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你走出去找就不认你这儿子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You walk out that door, you are cut off, young man.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.80,0:20:14.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,懂吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You understand me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.47,0:20:16.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 我不要你了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, that's it! You are cut off!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.98,0:20:18.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这是何必呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Johnny, why won't you change your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.98,0:20:21.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当公民这么重要吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Does citizenship mean that much to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.98,0:20:24.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然重要{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, yeah, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.19,0:20:26.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希望如此{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I hope so.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.19,0:20:28.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希望你别为了穿帅制服的...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hope you don't ruin your life over some silly little girl...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.82,0:20:30.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,女孩而自毁前程{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who wants to look handsome in a uniform.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.86,0:20:33.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 别这么说卡门 - 强尼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Don't talk about Carmen that way! - Johnny.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.66,0:20:41.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听到什么吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you have everything?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.42,0:20:43.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.84,0:20:52.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,强尼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Johnny
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.30,0:20:55.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你迟到了 - 我父亲帮我收拾行李{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You're late. - My dad had to help me pack.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.10,0:20:57.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他怕再也见不到我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Suddenly he's afraid he's never gonna see me again or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.93,0:21:00.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他真好 不过很费时间{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was sweet, but it took forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.52,0:21:05.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我猜我准备好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh. Anyway, I guess I'm ready to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.36,0:21:08.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也是 我只剩这身衣服{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, me too. I'm wearing everything I own.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.20,0:21:13.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很遗憾你的父母反对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry your parents were mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.20,0:21:15.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,管它呢 反正...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who cares? The Federation will give me...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.66,0:21:17.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这两年军队会养我 对吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}everything I need for the next two years, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.58,0:21:23.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你和卡尔联络过吗? - 有 他早上就走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You talk to Carl? - Yeah, he left this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.38,0:21:27.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他不能说去哪里 - 能够入伍我好兴奋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Couldn't say where. - Oh, it's exciting, going away.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.30,0:21:30.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也很害怕 你不会吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I'm scared. Aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.05,0:21:36.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会很想你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna miss you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.39,0:21:40.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也会想你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna miss you too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.56,0:21:43.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我爱你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.73,0:21:46.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,前往特雷斯卡瓦的新兵准备启程{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Outbound group 94B to Tereshkova...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.90,0:21:48.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我该走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.03,0:21:54.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说一次 试试看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just say it once. Try it on for size.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.66,0:22:00.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我爱你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.63,0:22:10.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别忘了写信给我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't forget to write.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.84,0:22:12.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不会忘的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.85,0:22:25.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(联邦电视网)
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.75,0:22:27.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(世界团结一致)
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.52,0:22:30.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全自动步枪 谁想拿?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fully automatic Morita. Who wants to hold it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.19,0:22:31.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我! 我! 我...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Me! Me! Me! Me! Me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.53,0:22:35.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,公民万岁 人民创造美好明天{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Citizen rule. People making a better tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.61,0:22:43.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(你想知道更多吗?)
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.12,0:22:47.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杀人犯今天被捕后接受审判{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A murderer was captured this morning and tried today.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.25,0:22:49.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有罪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guilty.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.50,0:22:52.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,处以死刑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sentence.: death.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.26,0:22:55.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今晚六点行刑 实况转播{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Execution tonight at 6.:00. All net. All channels.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.98,0:22:57.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(你想知道更多吗?)
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.83,0:23:01.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(你能心灵感应吗?)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.60,0:23:06.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你觉得能{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you think you're psychic,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.60,0:23:07.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许是真的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}maybe you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.11,0:23:13.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各地都在进行这项研究{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Federal studies are being conducted in your community.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.96,0:23:15.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(你想知道更多吗?)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.53,0:23:20.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每个小学生都知道阿瑞克尼虫很危险{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Every school kid knows that Arachnids are dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.15,0:23:26.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(不宜观赏)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.12,0:23:29.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,摩门教徒却罔顾联邦警告{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}However, Mormon extremists disregarded Federal warnings...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.21,0:23:33.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在虫族隔离区建立教会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and established Fort Joe Smith deep inside the Arachnid Quarantine Zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.55,0:23:37.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不料该地区早就被别人占领{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Too late, they realized that Dantana had already been chosen by other colonists.:
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.80,0:23:39.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿瑞克尼虫族{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Arachnids.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.22,0:23:42.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(你想知道更多吗?)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.81,0:23:50.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 一 二 三 四! - 你们大半都...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- One, two, three, four! - Most of you will not...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.90,0:23:53.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,熬不过魔鬼训练{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}live to be in the Mobile Infantry.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.69,0:23:56.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为你们都不够强{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The trouble is, you are not good enough the way you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.45,0:23:58.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,手放好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hands at your side!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.66,0:24:00.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抬头挺胸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chin up.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.12,0:24:02.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是你们的教官辛姆中士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am your senior drill instructor, Career Sergeant Zim!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.99,0:24:05.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小腹缩紧 双腿并拢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Suck in that gut! Feet together!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.67,0:24:10.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我真是衰毙了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To think this had to happen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.08,0:24:13.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一群蠢蛋 算了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What a bunch of apes. No, strike that!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.59,0:24:14.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们逊毙了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't rate that good.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.96,0:24:17.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没见过...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never in my life have I seen...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.76,0:24:21.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你觉得很好笑?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you think I'm funny? Do I make you laugh?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.05,0:24:24.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你觉得我是小丑吗? - 对不起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Do you think I'm a comedian, son? - I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.81,0:24:28.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们随时都要尊称我为长官{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The first words and the last words out of your stinking holes will be "Sir"!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.02,0:24:31.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 明白吗? - 明白 长官{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Do you get me? - Sir, yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.23,0:24:33.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,绕着军营跑一圈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see that armoury? Run around it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.77,0:24:36.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我叫你跑就跑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Run, I said! Run, run, run!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.19,0:24:38.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 布隆斯基 跟他跑! - 快! 快!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Bronski, keep pace! - Move! Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.28,0:24:40.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你们觉得我太狠太不公平{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, anytime you think I'm being too tough...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.86,0:24:42.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或是开始想念老妈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}anytime you think I'm being unfair...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.82,0:24:46.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就马上退出{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}anytime you miss your mommy, quit!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.41,0:24:48.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,填好表格 签名 打包{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You sign form 1240-A, you grab your gear...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.91,0:24:51.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走上失败者的路{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you take a stroll down Washout Lane!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.54,0:24:53.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明不明白?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you get me?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.38,0:24:55.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 明白 长官! - 可悲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sir, yes, sir! - Pathetic!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.71,0:24:59.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全是一群孬种 不知道这里有没有好汉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wonder if there's a handful of guts in the whole bunch of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.05,0:25:05.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁认为他有办法打倒我?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, who here thinks they got what it takes to knock me down?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.18,0:25:07.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得我能 长官{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir! I guess maybe I do, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.73,0:25:21.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦! 天哪! 天哪!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ow! God! God!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.20,0:25:25.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你没事吧? - 没事 长官{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You all right, son? - Sir, yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.49,0:25:28.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的手好像断了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's my arm. I think it's broken, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.87,0:25:31.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 医官! - 天哪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Medic! - God.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.83,0:25:34.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,痛是心里想的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pain is in your mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.84,0:25:36.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 下一个是谁? - 长官{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who's next? - Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.84,0:25:39.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,新兵弗洛斯报到 长官{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Recruit Flores reporting for duty, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.10,0:25:52.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你特别要求转到这单位?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You specifically requested transfer from Fort Cronkite to this training unit?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.77,0:25:54.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我听说这里是最严格的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, I heard it was the best, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.56,0:25:57.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,的确是最严格{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.77,0:26:00.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你凭什么以为自己够资格?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But what makes you think you're good enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.62,0:26:09.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这女孩有种当班长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now that's the kind of gal who makes squad leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.75,0:26:11.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我才要当班长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's my job you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.15,0:26:40.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很想宰了辛姆中士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, I'd like to kill that Sergeant Zim.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.03,0:26:43.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你的态度很不好 - 小心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Whoa, improper attitude! - Watch it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.61,0:26:45.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 这样会被踢出去 - 再见吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- They'll kick you out for talking like that. - Bye-bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.82,0:26:47.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你肯定会走上失败走路{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There you go down Washout Lane.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.99,0:26:50.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没种就是没种{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yup, you either got what it takes, or you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.49,0:26:52.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我们在排队 - 你也要等 王牌{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey, there is a line. - Wait your turn, Ace.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.79,0:26:56.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别紧张 小兵 反正菜都很烂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, at ease, little soldier. It's all the same muck.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.54,0:26:58.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乖乖去排队{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get in line like everyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.26,0:27:11.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这阔少爷真有种{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got some guts for a rich kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.22,0:27:13.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咱们交个朋友 如何?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess you and me could be buddies. What do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.35,0:27:18.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 真是荣幸 - 当然 我最够朋友了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm honoured. - Hey! Of course you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.61,0:27:20.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每个人都应该有个像我这样的朋友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everybody should have a friend like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.82,0:27:23.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王牌 到后面排队吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Ace. Back of the line now! Back of the line!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.53,0:27:26.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 真是个混蛋 - 讨厌鬼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What a jerk, man. - Tough guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.24,0:27:30.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瑞哥 跟我一起吃饭{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Rico, want to sit together?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.28,0:27:31.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 谢了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No thanks, Diz.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.00,0:27:35.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有什么问题?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's your malfunction, Rico?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.33,0:27:39.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就是问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.38,0:27:42.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想一个人入伍 你却硬要跟来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I joined up to get out on my own, and you had to tag along.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.34,0:27:46.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你以为我为你入伍?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think I joined the Mobile Infantry because of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.72,0:27:48.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你敢说不是?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You saying you didn't?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.06,0:27:56.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗨{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.39,0:27:58.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想都别想 王牌 你不行的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Forget about it, Ace. You don't stand a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.06,0:28:01.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难道你就能当班长?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What makes you even think you're gonna make squad leader, Rico?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.02,0:28:03.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我比你有料 - 哈!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Something I got, you don't. - Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.78,0:28:06.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 有钱少爷只会装阔 - 才不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You rich kids are all the same. - It isn't about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.65,0:28:08.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 这得靠能力 - 嘿!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's about who's the best. - Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.13,0:28:21.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第三班{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Third squad!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.43,0:28:31.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,长官 我不懂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.47,0:28:33.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在核战争中何必用刀?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who needs a knife in a nuke fight, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.81,0:28:37.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要按下按钮就行 长官{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All you gotta do is push a button, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.56,0:28:41.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,暂停 手放在墙上 伞兵{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cease fire. Put your hand on that wall, trooper.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.40,0:28:47.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把手放在墙上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put your hand on that wall!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.33,0:28:58.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.67,0:29:07.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,敌人的手掌受伤就不能按钮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The enemy cannot push a button if you disable his hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.68,0:29:12.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,医官{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Medic!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.72,0:29:18.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们有一个共同点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah, well, we all have one thing in common.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.31,0:29:21.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们都蠢到要参加机动部队{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We were all stupid enough to sign up for Mobile Infantry.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.31,0:29:24.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 布雷肯瑞奇 你为何加入? - 我全家都是农夫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Breckinridge, what's your excuse? - Oh, my family's all farmers.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.48,0:29:26.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我讨厌务农 而机动部队...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hate farming. I mean, uh, Mobile Infantry...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.48,0:29:28.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比起来就像是在野餐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's like pure picnic by comparison.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.49,0:29:31.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乡巴佬真是又蠢又壮对不对?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, so they grow 'em big and dumb on the farm planet, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.99,0:29:34.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 而且帅! - 我就爱壮汉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And pretty! - I like big!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.45,0:29:37.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 蒂嘉娜 你呢? - 我想要从政{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Djana'D, what about you? - Oh, I'm going in for politics...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.49,0:29:39.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想从政就得成为公民{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and, you know, you gotta be a citizen for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.66,0:29:42.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 所以我就来了 - 你想负起责任{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- So here I am. - Ah, you want some responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.83,0:29:46.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 对 - 苏杰米 接着说吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah. - Shujimi, come on, let's keep it goin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.17,0:29:48.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我被哈佛大学取录{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got into Harvard, but my father says forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.67,0:29:49.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是我老爸嫌学费太贵{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's gonna cost an arm and a leg, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.01,0:29:51.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要服役{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, if I serve,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.80,0:29:54.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就能赚取学费{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Federation pays my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.51,0:29:55.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想生孩子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want to have babies.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.01,0:29:58.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,公民比较容易申请执照{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, it's a lot easier to get a licence if you've served.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.39,0:30:00.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 然后呢... - 我要当职业军官{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- So... - I'm going career.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.18,0:30:02.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,按步就班升上去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Officer's training. All the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.98,0:30:05.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,未来的星际元帅 瑞哥 该你了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Future Sky Marshal. All right, Rico, your turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.86,0:30:09.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要多管闲事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who asked you to be so nosy?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.36,0:30:11.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么? 我是坏人吗? 我想当作家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? I'm the-the bad guy? I'm gonna be a writer, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.53,0:30:14.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然能管闲事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A writer's got a right to be nosy.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.36,0:30:17.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,弗洛雷斯 你和瑞哥都来自布宜诺斯艾利斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Flores, you know Rico from Buenos Aires.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.24,0:30:21.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他为什么入伍? - 哦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's his story? - Oh, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.54,0:30:23.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是为了一个女孩子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he's here because of a girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.37,0:30:27.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瑞哥 大情圣{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, Rico! Lover boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.38,0:30:32.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他让我感到兴奋 - 他一定会打你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He's getting me excited. - He's gonna blow.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.84,0:30:37.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为了你吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is it you?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.06,0:30:45.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是我们的宿舍 很简陋 不过是我的家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is where we live. It's not much, but it's home.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.90,0:30:49.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是我的床铺 我每晚都梦到你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right there, that's my bunk, where I dream about you every night.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.07,0:30:52.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,训练很辛苦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Boot's pretty tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.74,0:30:55.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有时我很灰心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sometimes I think I won't make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.45,0:30:57.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过我一想到你就会更努力{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But then I think about what you're doing, and I try harder.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.66,0:31:03.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 嘿 你介意吗? - 努力点 宝贝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey, guys! Do you mind? - Try harder, baby, try harder!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.46,0:31:12.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁知道? 也许我会成为班长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who knows? They might even make me squad leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.59,0:31:14.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我得上床了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh-oh, I better pack it in.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.42,0:31:18.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我爱你 宝贝 我爱你!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, I love you, baby, I love you!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.10,0:31:21.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 写信给我 - 我是如此爱你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Write me! - I love you so much
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.85,0:31:24.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我要杀了你 - 我是如此爱你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm gonna kill you guys! - I love you so much
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.40,0:31:28.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 再见 记得写信 - 再见!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Bye! Write me. - Bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.52,0:31:32.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,五分钟后绕行月球 艾邦妮兹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Orbit in five, Ibanez.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.69,0:31:34.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先到先飞{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}First one there gets to fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.21,0:31:52.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 关闭舱门 - 等一下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Locking it down. - Wait! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.42,0:31:57.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别让艾邦妮兹驾驶 她太疯狂了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no. Not Ibanez again. She's crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.30,0:31:59.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,准备 发射{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ready, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.93,0:32:07.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.10,0:32:10.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伸出机翼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Deploying wings.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.69,0:32:57.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你干嘛这么开心?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How come you're in such a good mood, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.19,0:32:59.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天我要开战舰{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}'Cause today I get to fly that.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.47,0:33:24.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,飞行受训人员艾邦妮兹报到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pilot Trainee Ibanez reporting for duty, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.97,0:33:26.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,坐在副驾驶座{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take the number two chair, Ibanez.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.89,0:33:29.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 是的 女士 - 看见啦?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yes, ma'am. - You see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.48,0:33:37.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 辨识身份 - 艾邦妮兹 T-325-A 正确{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Identify. - Ibanez, T-325-A, clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.74,0:33:45.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在这儿干嘛?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.91,0:33:48.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要教你驾驶这艘战舰{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm the guy whose gonna teach you to fly this crate.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.87,0:33:51.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,助理教官{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, Assistant Instructor.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.75,0:33:55.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我该尊称你长官吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Should I call you "sir"?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.34,0:33:58.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我下命令才要 - 准备起飞{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Only when I give you an order. - Prepare for departure.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.80,0:34:03.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没想到我们会再见面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's amazing, us running into each other like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.47,0:34:06.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 也许是命中注定 - 也许不是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Maybe it's fate. - Maybe not.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.30,0:34:09.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我听说有个女孩很优秀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Heard about this crazy girl coming through the Academy.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.56,0:34:14.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她是天生好手 只是有点野{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Solid math, a little wild on the stick, but a natural.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.27,0:34:15.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道是你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And when it turned out to be you,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.81,0:34:18.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就安排和你见面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just made sure that we would run into each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.11,0:34:20.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杨罗杰号可以起飞{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rodger Young cleared for undocking and departure.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.90,0:34:22.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 艾邦妮兹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, Ibanez.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.82,0:34:25.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 开出去吧 - 是的 女士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Take her out. - Yes, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.45,0:34:28.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,系统正常{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All systems go.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.31,0:34:55.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,进行模拟飞行时老师都跟不上我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In simulation, my supervisors could never keep up.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.98,0:34:57.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这不是模拟飞行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, this isn't simulation any more...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.86,0:35:00.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小心点 军校生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so take her out easy, cadet.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.57,0:35:01.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 长官{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.91,0:35:12.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,距离五米{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Five metres from object.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.62,0:35:17.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,距离三米{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three metres from object.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.92,0:35:23.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,通过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.26,0:35:29.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 别超过起飞速限 - 否则呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Don't exceed port speed. - Or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.30,0:35:34.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的飞行权会被取消 还有我的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or they revoke your flight status, and mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.77,0:35:38.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的前途掌握在我手上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your career is in my hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.32,0:35:46.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,慢慢来 副驾驶{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Steady as she goes, Number Two.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.78,0:35:49.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 准备超光速飞行 - 是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Prepare for warp. - Yes, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.12,0:35:52.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一号 计算木星航道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Number One, design for Jupiter orbit.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.45,0:35:56.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,准备转换超光速引擎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All crew, all sections, stand by to cut in C-drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.37,0:36:00.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,五...四...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Star drive in five, four...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.21,0:36:02.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,准备 稳定...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}ready, steady...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.59,0:36:04.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,启动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}go!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.16,0:36:29.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快进攻 快!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're going in! Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.04,0:36:40.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们冲不破防线{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Man, they're defended. No way in.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.92,0:36:45.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 翻跳动作 - 什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Flip six, three hole. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.38,0:36:48.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你做翻跳动作就能得分{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You run a flip six, three hole play, and you can score.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.22,0:36:49.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 掩护我 - 好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Cover me. - You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.06,0:36:59.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.28,0:37:08.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 谢了 哥们 - 杂种{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Thanks, buddy. - Bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.91,0:37:19.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.92,0:37:26.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那小子很灵活{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kid's got some moves.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.05,0:37:28.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让他当班长 看看他的能耐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give him a squad. See what he can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.93,0:37:35.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小猫咪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kitty, Kitty.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.81,0:37:38.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我得教你们打台球{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Someone's got to teach you guys how to play some pool here.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.56,0:37:40.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瞧他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at him.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.06,0:37:43.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那副得意样 真自傲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you ever seen anybody so pleased with himself?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.90,0:37:47.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,辛姆一定得选个乖乖牌{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, Zim must have had to choose someone to be his brownnose.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.70,0:37:55.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有你我就办不到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I couldn't have done it without you, Diz.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.41,0:37:58.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,朋友?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.54,0:38:03.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,朋友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.25,0:38:06.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 信来了 李维 - 我就是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Mail call! Levy! - Yeah, that's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.92,0:38:09.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 苏杰米 - 在{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Shujimi! - Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.59,0:38:11.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 瑞哥 - 在{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Rico. - Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.09,0:38:13.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 布雷肯瑞奇 - 嗯 在{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Breckinridge! - Yeah, right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.22,0:38:16.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 泰勒 - 我在这儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Niler. - Yeah, here I am. Ah, great, my dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.43,0:38:18.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没了 大伙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's all, folks.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.90,0:38:27.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗨 强尼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi, Johnny.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.44,0:38:30.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉没早点写信给你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry I haven't written you sooner, but, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.11,0:38:32.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,噢...瑞哥 你配不上她{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, Rico,it's been really busy.you don't deserve that!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.78,0:38:34.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 嘘 嘘 - 他们真的在这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Shh, shh. - They've really got us going here.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.82,0:38:37.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你一定当上班长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They must have made you squad leader by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.45,0:38:39.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有的话 叫他们来找我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And if they haven't, tell 'em to talk to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.95,0:38:42.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你瞧 找到好女人就不用愁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See? All it takes is the love of a good woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.79,0:38:47.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 看这儿 - 别看了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Look at that.Look at those. - Stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.63,0:38:49.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是很美吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Isn't it beautiful?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.63,0:38:51.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我好爱这儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love it out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.97,0:38:56.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's also the problem
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.68,0:39:00.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为 我想当职业军人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because I think I'm gonna go career.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.23,0:39:04.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要指挥战舰{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want to command a ship of my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.69,0:39:06.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样一来...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.32,0:39:09.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们就没时间{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't think that's gonna leave a lot of room...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.82,0:39:11.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,交往 强尼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for you and me, Johnny.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.36,0:39:18.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道你会很失望{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know that's not what you wanted to hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.99,0:39:20.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.50,0:39:26.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我得把握机会 对不起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have to follow my heart. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.88,0:39:31.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,写信给我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Write me, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.01,0:39:34.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我们永远当好朋友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Write me so that I know we'll always be friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.77,0:39:52.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 让我们回到游戏 - 我觉得很对不起强尼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Let's get back to the game. - I feel so sorry for Johnny.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.03,0:39:54.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她们总是伤透你的心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Funny how they always want to be friends...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.44,0:39:57.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,之后还想做好朋友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}after they rip your guts out, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.36,0:40:00.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是活该{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Well, it's what I deserve.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.66,0:40:03.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么意思?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.41,0:40:07.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会入伍全是为了她{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, I joined up for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.67,0:40:10.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有她我就不会来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wouldn't even be here if it wasn't for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.00,0:40:13.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在说什么? 你是靠自己当上班长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you talking about? You made squad leader on your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.59,0:40:19.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,至少你还有我差遣{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And, hey, you still got me to kick around.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.89,0:40:25.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好日子结束了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fun and games are over, children.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.39,0:40:27.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天要进行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will be firing live ammunition...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.52,0:40:29.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,实弹的模拟战斗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in a simulated combat environment.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.86,0:40:34.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们千万要小心进行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will exercise extreme caution on my assault course!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.32,0:40:37.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你们都明白了吗? - 明白 长官{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Do you get me? - Sir, yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.15,0:40:38.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瑞哥 带队出去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rico, take 'em out!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.45,0:40:43.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第一组跟我来 第二组十秒钟后出发{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}First fire team with me. Next team in ten seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.70,0:40:46.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最高分是180{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maximum score has been 2 80.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.62,0:40:50.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你们一定要更好 - 上吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I expect you to do better! - Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.76,0:41:00.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,苏杰米 趴下来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shujimi, stay down!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.56,0:41:12.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死 布雷肯瑞奇 别挡住我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey! Goddam it, Breckinridge, clear my line of fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.02,0:41:14.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的头盔坏了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's my helmet! It's all screwed up!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.07,0:41:16.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你会碍事的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're gonna blow the score!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.90,0:41:18.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 蠢蛋 - 妈的!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Damn! - Dumb shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.53,0:41:19.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快前进 怎么了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Diz, stay put! What's the problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.03,0:41:21.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 头盔有问题 - 给我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Damn thing keeps getting in my way! - Give it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.91,0:41:24.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每次出错都是你的问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How come whenever something goes wrong, it's always you, Breckinridge?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.28,0:41:25.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是因为我又蠢又壮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It must be 'cause I'm big and dumb!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.79,0:41:27.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, right!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.46,0:41:35.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,医官{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Medic!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.13,0:41:41.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瑞哥 你被解除班长职位{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rico, you are relieved of squad command!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.80,0:41:46.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是你准许新兵脱下头盔吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rico, did you give the recruit permission to remove his helmet?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.89,0:41:49.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 长官 布雷肯瑞奇说他的头盔坏了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, yes, sir. Breckinridge reported a helmet malfunction...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.85,0:41:51.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要他拿给我看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I asked him to show it to me, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.56,0:41:55.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你会修理M-3型头盔吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you rated to repair the M-3 Tactical Helmet, Rico?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.03,0:41:58.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不会 长官{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, no, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.57,0:42:00.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么你为何在实弹演习时...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then why did you order your man to remove his helmet...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.57,0:42:03.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,叫他脱下头盔?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}during a live fire exercise?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.24,0:42:06.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我需要每名队员尽全力{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, I needed everyone in my squad operational, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.91,0:42:10.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想要获胜 长官{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wanted to win, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.29,0:42:17.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,继续{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Carry on.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.10,0:42:29.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,军士 我们因为此事失去两名新兵{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sergeant, we've already lost two recruits over this incident.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.81,0:42:32.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你认为这个人还有前途吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you think there's any possibility of salvaging this man?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.73,0:42:36.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有的 长官{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, sir, I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.40,0:42:38.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.28,0:42:42.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让他接受行政处罚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll try administrative punishment.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.95,0:42:49.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,囚犯 站住{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Prisoner, halt!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.68,0:43:09.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用力咬{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bite down on this, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.68,0:43:12.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很有用 我很清楚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It helps. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.57,0:43:25.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为他指挥无能{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For incompetence of command...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.70,0:43:28.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在实弹演习中...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for failure to abide by safety regulations...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.41,0:43:31.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,违反安全规定...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}during a live fire exercise...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.91,0:43:35.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为他的疏失导致一名士兵死亡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for negligence which contributed to the death of a teammate...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.67,0:43:37.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,新兵强尼·瑞哥{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}recruit trainee John Rico...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.00,0:43:40.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,必须受刑...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is sentenced to administrative punishment.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.76,0:43:42.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,十下鞭刑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ten lashes.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.93,0:43:46.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开始行刑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You may carry out the sentence.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.14,0:43:56.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.73,0:43:59.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,二...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.57,0:44:02.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.95,0:44:06.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,四...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Four!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.87,0:44:10.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,五...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Five!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.04,0:44:14.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,六...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Six!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.04,0:44:17.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,七...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seven!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.04,0:44:21.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,八...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eight!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.71,0:44:23.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,九...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nine!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.72,0:44:26.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,十!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ten!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.41,0:44:50.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢了 你猜中我的心意{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks. You read my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.12,0:44:55.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下半夜更最难熬{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, third watch always seems to last forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.33,0:44:56.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不一定{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.08,0:44:59.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这得看你和谁一起值班{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It depends on who you're spending it with.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.34,0:45:04.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出了问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.63,0:45:12.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 那儿 - 我重新设定航道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- There. - No, I replotted the course.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.72,0:45:15.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 这样更有效率 - 你才来了三个星期...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's more efficient this way. - Three weeks aboard a starship...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.97,0:45:18.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就想跟我比?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you think that you can lick my navs?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.31,0:45:19.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尽管查{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Check it.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.73,0:45:27.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我和达拉第舰长谈过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, I was talking with Captain Deladier...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.90,0:45:29.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她说...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and, uh, she said...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.45,0:45:32.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别转移话题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't change the subject.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.12,0:45:33.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我对不对?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Am I right?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.79,0:45:43.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"新航道最佳" 你做得对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Yeah. You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.88,0:45:46.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么舰长怎么说?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, what did the captain say?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.63,0:45:50.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她说我们应该正式搭档...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She thinks that we ought to team up officially...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.43,0:45:55.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为她服务{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and crew for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.31,0:45:58.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你和我? - 我们是好搭档 卡门{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You and me, huh? - We're good together, Carmen.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.89,0:46:02.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各方面都领先{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're way ahead of the curve in every department.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.31,0:46:05.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们很有默契{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can anticipate you.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.40,0:46:08.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道我要什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.82,0:46:13.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道 你要什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.91,0:46:22.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太空中有重力场{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a gravity field out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.04,0:46:27.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 进行扫瞄 启动 - 那儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Run a scan. Sensors on. - There.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.01,0:46:33.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 重力2.25 继续增加... - 报告{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Gravity at 225 and rising. - Report.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.34,0:46:35.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,船长 前方有不明物体{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain, we're in the path of an unidentified object...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.39,0:46:37.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,向我们快速冲来...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}moving toward us at high speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.18,0:46:39.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,根据资料应该是小行星{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Profile suggests an asteroid, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.50,0:46:51.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(撞击警告)
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.74,0:46:54.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 六秒后撞击 - 紧急闪躲动作{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Impact, six seconds! - Emergency evasion!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.45,0:47:01.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三...二...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three, two,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.04,0:47:06.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,启动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.22,0:47:22.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,关闭21号舱门{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Close compartment 21!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.12,0:47:38.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从哪儿来的?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where'd it come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.62,0:47:41.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从虫族隔离区来的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It came out of the Arachnid Quarantine Zone, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.41,0:47:46.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,通讯官通知舰队小行星接近中{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Number Four, contact Fleet. Tell 'em there's a loose asteroid headed their way.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.42,0:47:48.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,通讯失效 全都被摧毁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Communications are down, ma'am. They're gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.25,0:47:53.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 估计损失 - 舰身受损{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Damage assessment. - Hull's compromised.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.26,0:47:54.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们没死掉真走运{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're lucky to be alive, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.84,0:47:56.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这不是靠运气{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Luck didn't have anything to do with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.05,0:47:59.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们的飞行小组很优秀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have a hell of a flight team.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.28,0:48:17.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不能离开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It really stinks, you going.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.74,0:48:20.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,机动部队没有我也一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, well, the Mobile Infantry will just have to get along without me.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.79,0:48:27.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不懂 瑞哥 你接受了惩罚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't get it, Rico. You took your licks.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.71,0:48:29.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果他们不想要你 可以把你踢走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If they didn't want you, they would have kicked you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.46,0:48:30.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.34,0:48:34.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不该入伍 我害死人...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I joined up for the wrong reasons. I got a guy killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.46,0:48:36.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就证明我没有能力{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I figure that kind of proves I don't have what it takes.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.88,0:48:40.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瑞哥 电话接通了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rico, your call's going through.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.51,0:48:42.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去接{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take it there.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.48,0:48:52.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 喂? 强尼 - 嗨 妈妈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hello? Oh, Johnny! - Hi, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.86,0:48:54.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比尔 快接电话 是强尼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}B-Bill, pick it up. It's Johnny!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.99,0:48:56.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 强尼? - 爸爸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Johnny? - Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.86,0:48:58.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你的制服呢? - 比尔...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where's your uniform? - Bill.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.07,0:49:01.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,见到你真好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's just good to hear from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.08,0:49:04.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好吗? 儿子?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How are you, son?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.45,0:49:06.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不适合这里 爸爸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not really working out here for me, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.79,0:49:08.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在想...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was thinking...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.37,0:49:10.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道我能不能回家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was hoping it would be all right if I came home.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.38,0:49:13.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然能 马上回来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, of-of course. You should come home immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.84,0:49:17.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起 我太傻了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry. I've been an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.17,0:49:19.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别这么说 你先回家...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't talk like that. You just come on home...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.55,0:49:20.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咱们再好好谈谈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}talk things out.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.35,0:49:23.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们很爱你 儿子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We love you, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.18,0:49:27.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 那是什么? - 好像要下雨{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- My, what's that? - Looks like rain.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.85,0:49:30.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 这时候? - 外面好暗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- This time of year? - Sure is dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.60,0:49:32.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大气干扰导致...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your transmission has been terminated...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.40,0:49:34.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,通讯中断{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}due to atmospheric interference.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.03,0:49:36.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请稍后再试{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please try your call again later.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.20,0:49:44.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, see ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.87,0:49:48.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就这样退出...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, you take that stroll down Washout Lane...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.37,0:49:50.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只证明一件事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you're only proving one thing,Johnny.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.29,0:49:51.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么事?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's that, Diz?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.21,0:49:58.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你没有资格当公民{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That you don't have what it takes to be a citizen.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.91,0:50:28.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么事?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.08,0:50:35.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗨 发生什么事?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, hey, what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.59,0:50:37.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发生什么事?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wh-What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.42,0:50:41.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 嗨 Kitten 怎么回事? - 战争 我们要去参战了...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey, Kitten, what's going on? - It's war! We're going to war!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.43,0:50:49.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这次的灾难前所未有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The devastation we are seeing is unparalleled.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.14,0:50:54.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,根据估计有数百万人丧命 一座城市全毁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Judging from early estimates, millions dead, a city in ruins.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.10,0:50:56.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是日内瓦吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that Geneva?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.27,0:50:58.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,强尼 是该死的大虫攻击我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goddam bugs whacked us, Johnny.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.19,0:51:01.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虫族从大本营克兰达夫星球...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The meteor was shot out of orbit by bug plasma...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.61,0:51:05.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发射电浆把陨石撞离轨道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that derived from Klendathu, the Arachnids'home planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.79,0:51:17.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个曾被称为拉丁乐园的城市片瓦不留{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing lives in what was once called the Latin Paradise.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.38,0:51:18.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,强尼 那是我们...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh,Johnny, it's us.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.80,0:51:22.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,布宜诺斯艾利斯完全消失{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Buenos Aires has been wiped off the Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.05,0:51:28.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...我们的家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's home.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.14,0:51:34.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刚才联邦委员会一致表决...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Federal Council met moments ago and voted unanimously...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.23,0:51:38.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全体动员消灭虫族大敌{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for mobilization to destroy the Arachnid threat.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.86,0:51:41.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(8764608人死亡)
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.86,0:51:46.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我是认真的 我要去 - 辛姆 你得留下来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm serious. I'll go anywhere. - Forget it, Zim. We need you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.07,0:51:49.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我要打仗 - 只有一种方法能让你去打仗...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I want combat, sir. - The only way you're gonna see combat...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.08,0:51:51.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被降为二等兵!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is if you bust yourself to private!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.08,0:51:55.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 明白? - 我明白 长官{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Get me? - Yes, sir, I get you.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.17,0:51:58.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 长官 - 你要做什么? 瑞哥{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sir! - What do you want, Rico?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.38,0:52:01.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要收回退出的要求{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wish to reconsider my request to drop out, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.51,0:52:03.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你已经签好表格{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You already signed your 1240-A, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.67,0:52:07.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 那是非法的 - 少校 我不该退出{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It wouldn't be legal. - Major, I know it was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.43,0:52:10.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没吸取教训 反而又犯错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't learn from one mistake, and I made another, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.26,0:52:12.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你做出决定{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You made your decision, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.27,0:52:16.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,长官 我全家都在布宜诺斯艾利斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, my family, my whole family, was in Buenos Aires, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.86,0:52:22.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瑞哥 这是你的签名吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is this your signature, Rico?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.03,0:52:24.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 长官{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, yes, it is, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.41,0:52:32.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看起来不像{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doesn't look like it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.87,0:52:38.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 去吧 二等兵 - 是的 长官{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Carry on, Private! - Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.59,0:52:43.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(联邦电视网)
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.97,0:52:46.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(战争)
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.85,0:52:55.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看到布宜诺斯艾利斯市的残骸先是悲痛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Out of the ashes of Buenos Aires comes first sorrow...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.98,0:52:57.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接下来是愤怒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}then anger.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.69,0:53:00.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有死虫才是好虫子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The only good bug is a dead bug.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.73,0:53:03.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,联邦委员会在日内瓦开会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In Geneva, the Federal Council convenes.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.90,0:53:07.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们必须誓死...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We must meet the threat with our valour, our blood...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.70,0:53:09.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,勇敢面对挑战{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}indeed, with our very lives...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.99,0:53:14.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,捍卫人类文明{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to ensure that human civilization, not insect...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.66,0:53:18.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别让虫族永远统治银河系{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}dominates this galaxy, now and always!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.83,0:53:21.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,狄恩元帅...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sky Marshal Dienes announces plans...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.50,0:53:23.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,向虫族陨石来源...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for an offensive against Klendathu...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.54,0:53:26.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,克兰达夫星球宣战{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}source of the bug meteor that destroyed Buenos Aires.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.46,0:53:29.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(你想知道更多吗?)
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.55,0:53:33.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,联邦科学家每天不断研究新方法消灭虫族{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Every day, Federal scientists are looking for new ways to kill bugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.05,0:53:36.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一般的虫族战士很笨...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your basic Arachnid warrior isn't too smart...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.52,0:53:37.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是打断它的一只脚...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but you can blow off a limb...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.69,0:53:43.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它却能保留八成战斗力{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and it's still 86 percent combat effective.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.36,0:53:47.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有一个窍门: 瞄准神经干 把它撂倒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here's a tip.:Aim for the nerve stem, and put it down for good.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.53,0:53:53.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(你想知道更多吗?)
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.87,0:53:56.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人人都出力 你呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everyone's doing their part. Are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.08,0:54:01.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,战争需要每个人贡献力量{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Die! Die! The war effort needs your effort...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.71,0:54:04.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,家庭 工作和社区...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}at work, at home, in your community.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.88,0:54:07.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(胜利倒数)
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.92,0:54:09.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里是...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We now break net and take you live...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.72,0:54:12.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,位于虫族隔离区的...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to Fleet Battle Station Ticonderoga...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.09,0:54:14.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,提康德鲁加星际战舰基地{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}deep inside the Arachnid Quarantine Zone...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.72,0:54:19.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,英勇的星舰战将准备出击{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}where the men and women of the Federal Armed Services prepare to attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.39,0:54:23.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,准备连线...开始{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}D XQ uplink on two, one. You're on.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.40,0:54:25.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里没人知道何时开始...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one here in the AQZ knows exactly...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.73,0:54:27.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,进攻克兰达夫星{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when the invasion of Klendathu will occur.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.07,0:54:29.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都在猜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But everyone's talking about it...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.90,0:54:31.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,觉得也许是明天{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the talk says tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.90,0:54:34.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来机动部队想大嚼虫族{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here's a bunch of MI kids that look like they could eat bugs for lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.91,0:54:36.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 好吃 好吃 好吃 - 大兵{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yum, yum, yum. - So, trooper,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.91,0:54:38.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不怕大虫吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you're not too worried about fighting the Arachnids?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.74,0:54:41.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要发射一枚核弹 大虫就死翘翘{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, shoot a nuke down a bug hole, you got a lot of dead bugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.50,0:54:44.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希望全炸死之前 我能打死几只虫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Am I right? I just hope it's not over before we get some.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.67,0:54:46.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 得了 - 有人说虫族生态...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Okay, come on. - Some say the bugs were provoked...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.59,0:54:49.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,遭到了破坏才对人类反击{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}by the intrusion of humans into their natural habitat...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.34,0:54:53.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们该和平共处不该对虫族开战{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that a "live and let live policy" is preferable to war with the bugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.43,0:54:54.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我告诉你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me tell you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.93,0:54:57.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是布宜诺斯艾利斯市人 我要消灭它们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm from Buenos Aires, and I say kill them all!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.10,0:54:58.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 对 - 继续{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah! - Go on,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.51,0:54:59.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 对! - 对啊!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah! - Oh, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.02,0:55:01.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,狠角色{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Big bad bugs, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.02,0:55:04.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咱们要去纹身{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, guys, we ought to get tattoos.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.19,0:55:05.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 一起去吧 - 好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey, let's all get cut together. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.60,0:55:06.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 纹身干嘛? - 什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What do I want a tattoo for? - Oh, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.02,0:55:08.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的皮肤太嫩吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your skin's too pretty? Come on, everybody's doing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.69,0:55:10.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,强尼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey,Johnny!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.36,0:55:13.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,强尼·瑞哥{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Johnny Rico.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.03,0:55:17.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡门{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Carmen?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.33,0:55:22.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,稍息{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh. At ease.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.71,0:55:25.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我休假 最好别戴军帽{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guess I ought to lose the hat when I'm off duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.83,0:55:30.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 嗨 蒂丝 - 卡门{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hi, Diz. - Carmen.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.34,0:55:34.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我妈说得对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My mother was right about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.05,0:55:36.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你穿制服很好看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You look great in a uniform.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.97,0:55:38.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也挺帅的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You look pretty good yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.77,0:55:42.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有什么消息?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, what do you hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.77,0:55:45.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,布宜诺斯艾利斯有没有人生还?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know about anyone who made it out of BA alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.81,0:55:48.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我试着不多想{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Most of the time I don't think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.48,0:55:50.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,假装是别人的事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like it happened to someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.19,0:55:54.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是突然觉醒时就哭个不停{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then it hits me, and I, uh, can't stop crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.49,0:55:58.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们还活着 这值得高兴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, we're still alive. Got to be happy about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.32,0:56:01.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看到我好像不高兴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't look very happy to see me.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.70,0:56:04.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我该高兴吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Should I be?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.16,0:56:08.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,强尼 现在不同 我们在打仗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Johnny, it's different now. We're at war.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.00,0:56:13.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们分开对你我都好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, I think what I did was probably the best thing for both of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.17,0:56:15.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事吧 中尉?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everything copacetic, Lieutenant?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.34,0:56:18.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,山德 记得强尼吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Zander, you remember Johnny.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.84,0:56:21.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我和山德是飞行搭档{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Zander and I are a flight team now.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.18,0:56:22.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,舰队最好的小组{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, and we're best in the fleet.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.35,0:56:26.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我懂了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.10,0:56:28.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样对你我最好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is the part that's best for both of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.02,0:56:31.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 别再装了... - 强尼 等等{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Don't do me any more favours. - Johnny, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.69,0:56:33.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,算了 他是机动部队{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, forget it, Lieutenant. He's Mobile Infantry.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.03,0:56:35.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们只会杀人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See, when you're trained to kill...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.03,0:56:38.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不懂得礼貌{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it just doesn't pay to be polite.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.53,0:56:40.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你对机动部队有意见吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got something to say about the Mobile Infantry?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.87,0:56:43.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你听得很清楚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think you heard me.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.83,0:56:46.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想打架吗 二等兵?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want to make something of it, Private?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.67,0:56:50.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不跟军官打架{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not with an officer. No, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.00,0:56:54.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 机动部队不是蠢蛋 - 我就撇开官阶{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- The MI doesn't mint stupid troopers. - Well, let's disregard rank.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.84,0:56:57.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,山德 别这样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Zander, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.17,0:57:00.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听到吗? 这无关官阶{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everybody hear that? Rank is not an issue here.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.72,0:57:03.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 别这样 - 他敢怎样?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Don't do this. - Come on. What's he gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.65,0:57:20.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来呀 臭大兵!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, jarheads!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.28,0:57:22.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要宰了你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let go of me! Come on! I'm gonna kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.78,0:57:27.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要你好看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna kill you! I'll kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.83,0:57:29.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,住手 快{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guys! Guys! Quit it! Come on! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.50,0:57:30.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他不值得 - 快 快{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He's not worth it! - Come on! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.79,0:57:36.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瑞哥 算了 机动部队和舰队一向不合{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Forget it, Rico! Mobile Infantry and Fleet don't mix. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.80,0:57:40.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧 走吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.60,0:57:43.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,臭大兵{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jarheads.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.43,0:57:49.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 机动部队万岁 - 耶!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Mobile Infantry rules! - Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.27,0:57:51.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,痛死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, God, that hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.40,0:57:54.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有办法让你更痛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, well, I got something that might hurt just a little bit more, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.11,0:57:59.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们要打仗 一定会赢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yeah! We're gonna fight, and we're gonna win!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.53,0:58:03.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(死神降临)
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.30,0:58:19.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是舰长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is the captain speaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.13,0:58:21.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全体人员准备降落{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All personnel prepare for drop.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.43,0:58:23.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,倒数三分钟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are at D-minus three and counting.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.31,0:58:38.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们是先锋部队{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are going in with first wave.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.48,0:58:40.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,敌人最多{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Means more bugs for us to kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.69,0:58:42.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,彻底消灭敌区{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You smash the entire area.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.28,0:58:44.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杀死所有长两只脚以上的东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You kill anything that has more than two legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.45,0:58:46.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 明白吗? - 我们明白 长官{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You get me? - We get you, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.00,0:59:37.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 星球表面射出电浆 - 虫族炮火{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Plasma, ma'am, from the planet. - Bug batteries.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.92,0:59:40.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,军事情报说威力应该不强{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}According to military intelligence, it'll be random and light.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.42,0:59:45.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 部队状况? - 情况是...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Drop status? - Drop is...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.09,0:59:47.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,35%降落到地面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}35 percent complete, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.68,0:59:54.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,慢慢来 副驾驶{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Steady as she goes, Number Two.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.53,1:00:11.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,记住你的训练 你会活着回去的!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember your training, and you will make it back alive!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.14,1:00:32.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,电浆威力很强 情报有误{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This isn't random or light. Someone made a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.14,1:00:33.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,部队全都降落了 女士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's it. We're empty, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.03,1:00:45.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有人犯了大错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Someone made a big goddam mistake!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.99,1:00:54.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快往上飞{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Break for high orbit!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.70,1:01:35.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走 走 走!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go, let's go, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.25,1:01:41.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,强尼!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Johnny!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.23,1:02:06.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,核弹待命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rockets up!Rocket crew, move up!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.01,1:02:32.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 核弹小组 利维 瑞哥... - 把它们炸死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Nuke 'em! Levy! Rico! - Heat 'em up!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.68,1:02:40.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 好了 - 发射{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Set. - Fire!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.23,1:02:49.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 跟我来 - 上吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Follow me! - Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.57,1:02:55.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第一排 左翼!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}First platoon, left flank!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.70,1:02:59.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,分散! 第一 二班 跟我来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Split up! First and second squads, follow me.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.91,1:03:02.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第二班掩护 第一班跟我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two, cover! One, with me!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.62,1:03:05.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一边到另一边{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Along side! Side to side!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.25,1:03:08.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开火{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fire!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.81,1:03:28.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它们来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here they come!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.99,1:03:34.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 王牌 我们该怎么办? - 我...不知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Ace, what are we doing? - Uh, I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.41,1:03:43.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我不知道 - 把它们全干掉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I don't know. - Kill them! Kill them all!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:50.42,1:03:52.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上呀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.38,1:03:57.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找死吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on! Come on! You want some?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.22,1:04:00.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要你们死!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here's some! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.39,1:04:01.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吃子弹吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here's some of this!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.23,1:04:07.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的天!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.40,1:04:09.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,苏杰米{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shujimi!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.90,1:04:11.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 不 不!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.20,1:04:15.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救命! 救命! 救命!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help! Help! Help!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.37,1:04:20.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不! 天哪!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! God!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.04,1:04:28.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快走吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.80,1:04:32.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,撤退{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fall back!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.57,1:05:01.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All units,What's going on? fall back to retrieval.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.74,1:05:03.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,收到讯号吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Repeat.You got com? All units...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.24,1:05:04.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全体撤退{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}fall back to retrieval.It's a general retreat!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.08,1:05:07.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 回运兵船上! - 快!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Back to the boats! - Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.25,1:05:08.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快 我们走!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.58,1:05:12.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里是被称为{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've just landed here on what cap troopers...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.25,1:05:14.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大K星的战场{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}are calling Big K...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.42,1:05:16.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第六机动部队展开攻击{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with the 6th Mobile Infantry Division.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.01,1:05:20.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这丑陋的星球全是大虫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's an ugly planet, a bug planet.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.09,1:05:22.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,威胁人类的生存...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A planet hostile to life as we...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.69,1:05:29.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救命啊!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help me!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.36,1:05:34.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快向右{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Squad right!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.70,1:05:49.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快走 快 快 快...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on! Go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.54,1:05:51.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快离开这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get out of here now!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.79,1:05:54.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 小心点! - 小心你的侧面! 小心你的侧面!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Watch your step! - Watch your flank! Watch your flank!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.05,1:05:56.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们被击溃{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}GXR, we're being overrun.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.81,1:06:09.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,基顿 不!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kitten, no!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.17,1:06:41.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 天哪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, God!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.68,1:06:45.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 天哪 哦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, God! Oh! Oh!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.50,1:07:06.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(联邦电视网)
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.93,1:07:10.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(一小时内十万人丧命)
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.04,1:07:16.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人类面临空前危机{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Crisis for humankind.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.79,1:07:19.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,舰队官员承认他们...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fleet officials admit they underestimated...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.21,1:07:22.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,低估虫族的防卫能力{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the Arachnids' defensive capability.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.72,1:07:25.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为克兰达夫星的惨剧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Accepting responsibility for Klendathu...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.39,1:07:27.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,狄恩元帅引咎辞职{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sky Marshal Dienes resigns.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.06,1:07:30.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,新任的元帅马休...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His successor, Sky Marshal Tahat Meru...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.72,1:07:33.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宣布她的战略{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}outlines her new strategy.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.39,1:07:35.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们必须{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To fight the bug...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:35.40,1:07:37.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,了解虫族才能致胜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we must understand the bug.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.90,1:07:41.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们绝对不能再重蹈克兰达夫的覆辙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can ill afford another Klendathu.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.77,1:07:43.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(你想知道更多吗?)
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.53,1:07:45.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,联邦科学家想...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Federal scientists struggle to explain...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.70,1:07:48.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,解释虫族的军事智慧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the intelligent military actions of the Arachnids.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.62,1:07:50.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虫族经过三百代{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When a colony reaches a certain size...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.79,1:07:53.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,进化一定会变聪明{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}300 generations or something, it gets smarter.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.58,1:07:54.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 聪明的虫子? - 快...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Insects with intelligence? - Now, wait...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.04,1:07:56.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你遇到过吗? 难以置信...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you ever met one? I can't believe...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.88,1:07:58.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 这种想法太荒谬了 - 请你听我说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I am hearing this nonsense. - Would you just wait a moment?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.88,1:08:01.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 这是我听过的最荒谬讲话 - 可能 可能{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- This is the most ridiculous conversation I have ever had. - Maybe... Maybe...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.92,1:08:05.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许有一种虫我们没见过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}there is some kind of bug that we haven't seen yet:
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.72,1:08:08.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,领导阶级 虫族首脑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A leadership caste, a-a hive brain.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.22,1:08:12.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虫族首脑? 虫子也会思考? 才怪...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Brain Bugs? Frankly, I find the idea of a bug that thinks offensive!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.91,1:08:30.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,星舰基地 杨罗杰号请求进入{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ticonderoga, this is Rodger Young requesting approach vector.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:30.66,1:08:32.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,收到 杨罗杰号{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Affirmative, Rodger Young.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.58,1:08:35.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,座标l00951{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One-zero-zero-niner-five-two.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.46,1:08:36.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欢迎回来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome back.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.92,1:08:40.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的天{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My God.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.17,1:08:44.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么会这样?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How could this happen?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.34,1:08:46.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们自以为比虫族聪明{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We thought we were smarter than the bugs.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.05,1:09:22.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(伤亡人数: 308563)
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.88,1:09:28.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很奇怪 几乎没有人被俘{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's strange. There's almost no wounded at all.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.55,1:09:30.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虫族不抓俘虏{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bugs don't take prisoners.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.01,1:09:39.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(强尼·瑞哥 阵亡)
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.69,1:09:41.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦...不...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.52,1:09:43.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.36,1:09:50.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 卡门... - 这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Carmen... - See it? Right there.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.48,1:10:15.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他在那儿 - 我们会把他叫醒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- There he is. - Come on, we'll just wake him up.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.32,1:10:19.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿 强尼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey,Johnny! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.82,1:10:22.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 瑞哥 - 强尼 醒醒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey, Rico! - Hey,Johnny!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.83,1:10:24.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 瑞哥 醒醒 - 你好吗 小鱼儿?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey, Rico!Wake up! - How you doin', fish boy?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.83,1:10:27.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看 你死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, look. You're dead!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.50,1:10:29.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你阵亡了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Killed in action!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:32.17,1:10:34.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 再过三天就能出来 - 三天{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Three more days. - Three days.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.17,1:10:36.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你出局了 - 再见{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And you're out. - Good as new. See you later.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.26,1:10:37.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回头见{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bye.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.79,1:11:08.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,新的部队怎么样?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So what do you hear about our new unit?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.62,1:11:11.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,硬汉部队消灭的大虫比谁都多{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Roughnecks killed more bugs than any other outfit on Big K.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.13,1:11:13.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听说中尉很严厉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, well, I hear their lieutenant's a real nutbuster.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.97,1:11:18.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,士官长是谁?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who's top kick?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.14,1:11:22.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想当吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want the job, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:22.89,1:11:24.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不介意{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wouldn't mind.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:24.31,1:11:26.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很介意{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I would.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.64,1:11:28.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只想出力{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just doing my part.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.06,1:11:30.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,命令{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Orders.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:33.15,1:11:34.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yours?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:34.65,1:11:36.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还到哪里打过仗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where you been besides Big K?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:36.48,1:11:40.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 土星外环 西格玛海滩 - 西格玛海滩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Outer rings, Zegema Beach. - Zegema Beach?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.45,1:11:42.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我一直想去那儿 - 好运气{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I always wanted to go there. - Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.91,1:11:47.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 不用去了 那里不存在了 - 听说你们的中尉挺麻烦的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's not there any more. - So, I hear your lieutenant's a real nutbuster.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.08,1:11:53.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别批评中尉 他救我一命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one talks about the lieutenant that way.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.92,1:11:56.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他救过我 - 也救过我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He saved my life. - Mine too.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.76,1:11:59.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我也是 - 还有我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Same for me. - Me too.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.43,1:12:04.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听起来他人很好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, sounds like he's quite a guy.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:04.43,1:12:06.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你以为是谁救了你?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who do you think saved your ass?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.27,1:12:10.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,待命 立正{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stand by. Attention on deck!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.11,1:12:25.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,新来的听好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is for you new people.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:25.28,1:12:27.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只有一个规则{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I only have one rule:
Dialogue: 0,1:12:27.41,1:12:30.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全力以赴 不能退缩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everyone fights. No one quits.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.87,1:12:33.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,否则我们杀了你们 明白吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't do your job, I'll shoot you.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:33.96,1:12:35.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明白吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you get me?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:35.29,1:12:37.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明白 长官{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We get you, sir!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.01,1:12:41.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 欢迎到硬汉部队 - 瑞斯加科的硬汉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Welcome to the Roughnecks. - Rasczak's Roughnecks!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.68,1:12:44.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,稍息 听好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At ease. Listen up.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.84,1:12:48.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,新的元帅有新的战略{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got a new Sky Marshal and a new battle plan.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.52,1:12:50.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先一一消灭克兰达夫...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're gonna clean out the systems outlying Klendathu...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.02,1:12:53.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,周围的星球{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}one planet at a time.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.27,1:12:55.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明天攻击探戈幽灵星{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tomorrow we hit Tango Urilla.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.52,1:12:59.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先进行轰炸然后再消灭残留的敌人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After Fleet glasses the planet, MI mops up.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.03,1:13:01.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,继续吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Carry on.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.54,1:13:54.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 分散开来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right. Spread out!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.21,1:13:57.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,核弹小组 找到虫穴就炸掉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fire teams! You locate a bug hole, nuke it.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.72,1:14:07.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,华肯 带上弗洛斯和瑞哥{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watkins, shake out Flores and Rico.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.72,1:14:10.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,收到 走吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Copy that. Move out!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:10.14,1:14:12.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第一排 我们到山谷{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}First platoon, we're going for that ridge.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.06,1:14:15.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 利维 跟我来 - 我要跟着瑞哥{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Levy, you're with me. - No, I'm in A Squad. I'm going with Rico.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:16.06,1:14:17.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给我闭嘴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shut up and follow me!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:55.98,1:14:57.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你喜欢那个?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, you like that?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.89,1:14:59.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吃屎的大臭虫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fungus-sucking sack of maggot puke!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:59.98,1:15:01.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,华肯 它死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's dead, Watkins! It's dead!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.69,1:15:08.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,死了就没什么可怕的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ain't much to look at after you scrape them off your boot.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.49,1:15:13.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发现虫穴 那儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bug hole. There.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.01,1:15:29.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,炸掉它 瑞哥{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nuke 'em, Rico!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.18,1:15:36.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,准备射击{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fire in the hole!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.36,1:15:50.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们受到攻击 快来支援{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watkins, we're under heavy attack. Position M-4.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.86,1:15:53.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 快去! - 快!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Get over here! - Move!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:03.21,1:16:06.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你需要除虫吗 小姐? - 闭嘴 大兵{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You got a bug problem, ma'am? - Ah, stow it, trooper!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:27.78,1:16:29.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大甲虫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tanker!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.94,1:16:33.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 妈的! - 快走吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh, shit! - Come on! Move!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:41.75,1:16:43.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,趴下来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get down!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:51.80,1:16:53.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟我来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.33,1:18:03.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,通知救援队{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay down, sucker!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:05.50,1:18:07.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呼叫检索{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Call for retrieval.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:07.17,1:18:10.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 医官 - 好身手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Medic! - Nice moves.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:10.34,1:18:12.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在哪儿学来的?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where'd you learn how to do that, soldier?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:12.67,1:18:15.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,学校里 你不记得吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Back in school, sir. Don't you remember?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:15.84,1:18:19.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我是球队队长 - 瑞哥{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I was captain of the team. - Rico?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:19.93,1:18:22.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 长官 - 我需要一名下士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sir. - I need a corporal.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:22.77,1:18:26.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在你阵亡之前你就当下士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're it until you're dead or till I find somebody better.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.27,1:18:29.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你 长官{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:29.36,1:18:32.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 好了 结束了 - 干得好 下士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- All right, saddle up! Show's over. - Way to go, Corporal.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:32.11,1:18:37.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我要一名班长 - 不行 找搞砸过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey, I need a squad leader. - Oh, no. No, I've been there and blew it.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:37.53,1:18:38.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只想杀敌{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm just here to fight.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:40.24,1:18:42.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about it, Diz?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:44.49,1:18:46.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来就是我了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looks like I'm your girl, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:51.38,1:18:53.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 待会儿见 - 好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Catch you later. - All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:59.01,1:19:00.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen up!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:00.97,1:19:04.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最好的士兵要有最好的享受{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I expect the best, and I give the best!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.02,1:19:09.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是啤酒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here's the beer!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:13.40,1:19:15.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是娱乐的东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here's the entertainment!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:19.86,1:19:21.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,玩得开心点 这是命今{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have fun! That's an order!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:22.95,1:19:24.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是我的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This one's for me!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:25.95,1:19:27.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢了 中尉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, Lieutenant!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:31.25,1:19:32.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瑞哥{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rico!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:34.05,1:19:36.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你很会除虫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You kill bugs good.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:36.21,1:19:37.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:39.38,1:19:41.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在战前认识中尉了吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You knew the lieutenant before the war.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.80,1:19:43.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他为人如何?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What was he like?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:43.81,1:19:46.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是个老师 什么都懂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was a teacher. Kind of like he knew it all.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:46.98,1:19:49.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总是带着微笑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He always had this little smile.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:49.14,1:19:52.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在他可笑不出来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, well, he don't smile much any more.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:52.65,1:19:56.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,死这么多人怎么笑得出来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, well, I guess your bottle fills up real quick when your kids get smeared.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.48,1:19:58.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 来吧 下士 - 我不跳舞了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come on, Corporal. - Ah, nah, I don't do that any more.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:59.03,1:20:01.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我记得你以前跳 来嘛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I remember when you used to dance. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:01.61,1:20:03.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我得下令吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do I have to pull rank?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:05.83,1:20:07.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 长官{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:16.17,1:20:21.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瑞哥 你问过我的意见 想听吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rico. You once asked me for advice. Want some now?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:21.34,1:20:24.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 想 长官 - 中尉 总部来电{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yes, sir. - Lieutenant, HQ is on the com.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:26.51,1:20:28.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看到好机会就要把握{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never pass up a good thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:37.53,1:20:40.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,华肯 喝啤酒吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watkins. Beer?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:02.68,1:21:05.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瑞哥 跳完舞你打算干嘛?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, Rico, what are you doing after the dance?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:52.89,1:21:54.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有什么好笑?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's so funny?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:55.81,1:21:57.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,世事真是难以预料{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, just the way things work out.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:15.50,1:22:17.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们终于在一起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We finally got together, Diz.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:21.17,1:22:22.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我爱你 强尼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love you,Johnny.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:33.27,1:22:34.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瑞哥{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rico!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:37.27,1:22:40.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,准备出动 欧文将军在P星遇难{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're moving out. There's been a distress call from General Owen on Planet P.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:40.19,1:22:42.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,穿好军服 十分钟后报到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So get your shit wired and report in ten minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:42.44,1:22:43.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:43.94,1:22:45.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁在那里?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who's that with you?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:49.03,1:22:51.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,弗洛斯 长官{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Flores, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:52.29,1:22:54.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,二十分钟吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make it 20 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:54.45,1:22:55.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 长官{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:56.87,1:22:58.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,二十分钟?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Twenty minutes?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:59.38,1:23:00.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,应该来得及{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:39.08,1:23:40.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,威士忌哨站 收到吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whiskey Outpost, do you copy?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:40.83,1:23:43.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是硬汉部队201 请回答{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Roughneck 2-0 on tac three. Come in, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.17,1:23:46.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,威士忌哨站 威士忌哨站{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whiskey Outpost, Whiskey Outpost,
Dialogue: 0,1:23:46.67,1:23:48.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是硬汉部队201{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}this is Roughneck 2-0 on tac three.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:49.01,1:23:51.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 将军有消息吗? - 没有 长官{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Any contact with General Owen? - No, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:51.34,1:23:52.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,连发送讯号都没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not even the transponder signal.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:52.85,1:23:56.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被山谷挡住 到高处去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's these canyons. Go to higher ground, Sergeant.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:02.23,1:24:04.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,威士忌哨站{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whiskey Outpost, Whiskey Outpost...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:04.19,1:24:06.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是硬汉部队{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}this is Roughneck 2-0 on...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:18.12,1:24:19.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把你的枪给我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sugar, your weapon.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:26.55,1:24:28.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救救我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help me! Help me!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:39.06,1:24:42.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我落入敌手 你们也要杀了我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd expect anyone in this unit to do the same for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:44.02,1:24:45.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 瑞哥 - 长官{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Rico. - Sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:45.86,1:24:47.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是代理士官长 带队{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're acting sergeant. Move 'em out.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:49.24,1:24:52.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们听到了 快走吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You heard the lieutenant! Saddle up!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:43.92,1:25:47.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天哪 有人血洗这地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jeez, someone really humped the bunk.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:47.38,1:25:49.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 华肯 - 长官{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Watkins. - Sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:49.67,1:25:52.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,检查哨站 检查死尸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Secure this compound. Police these bodies.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:52.09,1:25:55.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 长官 三个人上塔架 快点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, sir. Give me three up on the tower, now!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:55.34,1:25:57.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里和那里建立监视哨{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aye-aye.OP there! OP there!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:57.39,1:26:00.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,检查死尸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Away! Number Two, police up these bodies!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:00.14,1:26:02.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,里头好臭{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stinks in there.Second squad, come with me on the gate!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:02.18,1:26:04.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 瑞哥 - 是的 长官{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Rico! - Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:04.52,1:26:06.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们需要救援 这地方都是大虫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need retrieval. This place crawls.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:06.19,1:26:08.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再找人修好通讯连线{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get somebody in the communications tent and get me an uplink.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:08.52,1:26:10.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 长官 蒂丝 去吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, sir. Diz, check it out.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:10.48,1:26:11.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 知道了 - 指挥小组跟我来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Roger. - Command group with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:16.53,1:26:17.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天哪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah, shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:17.87,1:26:19.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,中尉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lieutenant!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:21.70,1:26:24.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们吃饭时遭到大虫偷袭{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dirty bugs came in right while they were having chow.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:30.55,1:26:33.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它们从这里进来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, this is where they got in.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:35.05,1:26:37.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,中尉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lieutenant.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:37.39,1:26:40.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你最好来看看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think you're gonna want to see this.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:40.18,1:26:41.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么事 弗洛斯?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you got, Flores?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:41.85,1:26:43.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这地方真可怕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}God, I hate this place.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:58.70,1:27:01.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你觉得这是什么? 瑞哥?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What does that look like to you, Rico?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:03.87,1:27:05.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来虫钻进他大脑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looks like a bug was in his brain, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:15.55,1:27:18.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它们吸光他大脑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They sucked his brains out.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:27.56,1:27:28.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打开来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Open that.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:32.40,1:27:34.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,立正{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Officer on the deck!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:34.32,1:27:36.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 把将军扶起来 - 走了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Pick up the general. - Gone?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:36.90,1:27:38.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,安全吗? 我们得快走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is it safe? We've got to get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:38.57,1:27:40.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 将军 长官 - 我们...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- General!, Sir! - We've gotta...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:44.24,1:27:48.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你 谢谢你们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank God for you, all of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:48.16,1:27:51.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们都是英雄 你们全都是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're all gonna be heroes. Every last one of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:51.50,1:27:53.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 把洞穴封起来 - 好的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Close that hole. - Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:54.09,1:27:57.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我得逃命 联邦秘密太重要{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had to evade capture. The security of the Federation was at stake.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:01.18,1:28:03.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道这地区的攻击战略{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have operational knowledge of what we're up to out here.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:04.01,1:28:06.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 赶快连线 - 我正在努力{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Flores, I need that uplink. - Working on it, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:06.52,1:28:08.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn it.See?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:08.60,1:28:10.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它们钻进你的大脑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They get in your mind.Battlegroup, this is Roughneck 2-0.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:10.35,1:28:11.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你看法利的下场 - 你知道吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Look, they did it to Farley. - Do you read?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:12.02,1:28:14.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它们钻进你的大脑 逼你做事情{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They got in his mind.Come in, Battlegroup. This is Roughneck 2-0.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:14.19,1:28:17.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它们逼法利联络指挥部{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They make you do things. They made Farley call headquarters.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:17.36,1:28:19.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,求救讯号是个圈套{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The distress call was a trap.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:19.20,1:28:22.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它们也想知道我们的底细{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're just like us. They want to know what makes us tick.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:22.66,1:28:24.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,摸清我们的弱点 这样才能消灭我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They want to know us, so they can kill us.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:24.70,1:28:26.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,敌人会来袭 准备迎战{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Roughnecks, this is lead. Prepare for attack.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:26.70,1:28:29.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我们会被攻击 - 救援机在哪呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I repeat, we're gonna be attacked. - Where's the retrieval boat?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:29.12,1:28:32.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,紧急状况这是硬汉部队 收到吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mayday. Mayday. This is Roughneck 2-0 to Battlegroup. Do you read?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:32.13,1:28:33.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 天哪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, God!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:34.04,1:28:36.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天哪 我们死定了 懂吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're gonna die! Don't you understand?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:37.05,1:28:38.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们都要死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're all gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:39.97,1:28:41.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第二阵容 跟我来!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Second squad, follow me!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:41.47,1:28:44.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 克制一下自己 将军 - 不行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Control yourself, General. - I can't.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:44.51,1:28:46.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不行 我做不到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:46.14,1:28:47.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你干脆杀死我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wish you'd just shoot me.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:50.14,1:28:53.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,中尉 他的脑袋不清楚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lieutenant! He's just a little out of his mind, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:54.81,1:28:56.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大虫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bugs! Bugs!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:56.82,1:28:59.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Die! All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:59.15,1:29:02.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,准备好 全力开火{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Warm it all up! Everything you've got!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:02.16,1:29:04.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 快 - 大兵们 拚命吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Move! - Come on, you apes!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:04.32,1:29:05.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们想一直活着吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want to live forever?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:08.20,1:29:09.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 这儿! - 我这边有虫子!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Here! - I got bugs!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:39.98,1:29:41.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开火吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fire at will!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:21.73,1:30:23.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,飞虫来袭{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Incoming!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:55.19,1:30:57.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瑞哥 连线好了吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rico, where's my communication?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:57.48,1:30:59.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 蒂丝 连线呢? - 再等一分钟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Diz, status on the uplink! - Give me a minute.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:59.65,1:31:01.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们没有一分钟了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't have a minute!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:10.83,1:31:12.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,舰队 这是硬汉部队{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Battlegroup, this is Roughneck 2-0. We are under...
Dialogue: 0,1:31:12.99,1:31:16.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 这里是杨罗杰号 请说 - 我们受袭 请来救援{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- This is Rodger Young. Go ahead. - We are under attack, sir. We need retrieval now!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:16.16,1:31:17.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,P星球没敌人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have Planet Pas clear.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:17.67,1:31:19.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到处都是 快来接人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This place crawls, sir. We need pickup now!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:19.83,1:31:22.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 说出位置 - 追踪无线电讯号{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's your position? - Come down on this transmission.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:22.17,1:31:23.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哨站? 太疯狂了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Inside the outpost? That's crazy!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:23.84,1:31:25.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希望飞行员也疯狂 完毕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I hope you have a crazy pilot. Out!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:58.29,1:31:59.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,中尉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lieutenant!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:00.00,1:32:01.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救援机正赶来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Boat coming down, sir!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:01.67,1:32:05.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,退进去 快撤{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fall back into the compound! Fall back!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:29.86,1:32:32.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全力抵挡敌人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold here! Hold what you've got!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:43.21,1:32:44.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,弹药快没了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Running low!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:45.88,1:32:47.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm out!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:47.38,1:32:49.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拿去 省着点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here! Make 'em count!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:09.07,1:33:10.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,掩护救援机 撤{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make cover fire! Fall back!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:27.09,1:33:28.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快 快 快{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move, move, move!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:31.26,1:33:33.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快登机 撤{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fall back to the boat! Haul ass!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:47.48,1:33:49.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我的天 - 哦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh, my God! - Oh!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:53.20,1:33:55.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 把他拉上来 - 快{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Get him outta there! Pull! - Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:01.96,1:34:04.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瑞哥 瑞哥{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rico! Rico!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:05.46,1:34:08.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你知道该怎么做 - 是的 长官{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You know what to do! - Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:13.47,1:34:15.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快下手 瑞哥{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do it, Rico!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:40.33,1:34:42.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 嗯! - 蒂丝!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah! - Dizzy!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:04.77,1:35:06.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:06.60,1:35:09.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王牌 帮我拉住她{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ace, help me! Hold her down!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:14.36,1:35:16.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把她抬上机{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move! Get her into the boat!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:18.11,1:35:19.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蒂丝 千万别死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Diz! Don't die on me!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:19.99,1:35:21.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把她抬走 快{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's get her out! Let's go, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:27.71,1:35:29.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快上去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go! Get aboard!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:31.04,1:35:32.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们 快点...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tower, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:39.05,1:35:42.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快来吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's move it, tower! Run!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:49.02,1:35:50.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,升空{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lift off!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:21.01,1:36:25.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 强尼 我快死了 - 不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Johnny, I'm dying-dying. - No.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:25.56,1:36:27.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 你不会有事的 蒂丝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're gonna be all right, Diz.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:27.81,1:36:30.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没关系{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's all right...
Dialogue: 0,1:36:31.06,1:36:33.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我爱过你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because I got to have you.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:40.99,1:36:43.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别放开我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Johnny, don't let me go!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:43.12,1:36:44.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,强...强...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Joh...Joh...
Dialogue: 0,1:36:44.95,1:36:46.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别放开...别放开...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't let... Don't let...
Dialogue: 0,1:37:11.52,1:37:13.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要你知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think you should know...
Dialogue: 0,1:37:14.48,1:37:16.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的朋友瑞哥在后面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}your friend Rico is back there.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:26.03,1:37:29.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快通知舰队轰炸这星球{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get on the com and tell Fleet to glass that rock.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:29.87,1:37:31.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁下的命令 下士?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On whose authority, Corporal?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:31.66,1:37:34.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的命令 任务由我指挥{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That would be mine, sir. I assumed command of the mission.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:36.17,1:37:38.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杨罗杰号 我正式代表{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rodger Young, we have an official request...
Dialogue: 0,1:37:38.71,1:37:41.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,机动部队要求轰炸P星球{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}by the Mobile Infantry to commence bombardment of Planet P.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:43.18,1:37:45.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我以为你死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought you were dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:45.68,1:37:48.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没死 很多战友都死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not, but a lot of my troopers are.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:48.85,1:37:50.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Negative on your request, DeRuyter.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:50.89,1:37:53.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,元帅另有安排{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Sky Marshal has other plans for Planet P.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:53.19,1:37:54.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欢迎回来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome back.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:54.52,1:37:57.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,机动部队负责死 舰队负责飞{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}MI does the dying. Fleet just does the flying.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:57.69,1:37:59.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等 有动静了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold on. Something's up.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:59.69,1:38:02.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,舰队要进行大规模行动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fleet's mobilized for a big operation.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:31.00,1:38:32.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,立正{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Attention on deck!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:39.92,1:38:41.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有人曾问我...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Once somebody asked me...
Dialogue: 0,1:38:41.92,1:38:44.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,公民和平民...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if I knew the difference between a citizen...
Dialogue: 0,1:38:44.43,1:38:46.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有何不同{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and a civilian.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:46.43,1:38:48.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我现在知道了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can tell you now.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:48.10,1:38:50.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,公民有...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A citizen has the courage...
Dialogue: 0,1:38:50.27,1:38:54.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,捍卫人类安全的勇气{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to make the safety of the human race their personal responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:58.94,1:39:01.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蒂丝是我朋友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dizzy was my friend.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:01.44,1:39:03.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她也是战士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She was a soldier.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:03.65,1:39:05.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,更重要的是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But more than that...
Dialogue: 0,1:39:05.61,1:39:08.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她是联邦公民{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}she was a citizen of the Federation.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:10.45,1:39:12.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,敬礼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Present arms!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:30.89,1:39:33.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Order arms!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:37.06,1:39:38.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,向左转{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Left face!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:52.91,1:39:54.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 立正 - 继续{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Officer on deck! - Carry on.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:56.58,1:39:59.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,治葬队伍解散{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Burial detail dismissed.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:06.26,1:40:08.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,稍息{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At ease.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:08.59,1:40:11.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你好吗 卡尔? - 我很好 卡门{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How are you, Carl? - Carmen, good.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:11.93,1:40:14.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,强尼 我很遗憾你们被派到P星球{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Johnny, I'm sorry it had to be your unit on P.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:14.93,1:40:17.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那次任务的生还率很低{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That mission had a very low survival probability.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:17.48,1:40:19.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虫族设下圈套 对吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The bugs laid a trap for us, didn't they?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:20.94,1:40:23.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,证明它们有智慧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Elegant proof of intelligence, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:23.44,1:40:25.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我早就猜到P星球上有虫族首脑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We thought there might be a Brain Bug on P.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:25.99,1:40:27.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你早就知道却派他们下去?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You knew, and you sent them anyway?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:27.99,1:40:31.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们找不到首脑就不能进行攻击{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We couldn't afford to launch an operation if there wasn't one.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:33.28,1:40:36.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不苟同 很遗憾{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't approve. Well, too bad.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:36.79,1:40:38.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,事关人类存亡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're in this for the species, boys and girls.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:38.79,1:40:41.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它们数量众多{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's simple numbers. They have more.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:41.25,1:40:42.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我每天都得决定...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And every day I have to make decisions...
Dialogue: 0,1:40:43.09,1:40:45.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,派你这种人去送死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that send hundreds of people like you to their deaths.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:46.01,1:40:48.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难道你不知道吗 中校?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Didn't they tell you, Colonel?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:48.47,1:40:50.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,机动部队专门送死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's what the Mobile Infantry is good for.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:50.89,1:40:53.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希望你还能再战{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hope you're ready for more.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:53.76,1:40:57.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们要回去活抓首脑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're going back to P to capture that Brain.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:59.10,1:41:01.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,硬汉部队随时备战{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Roughnecks are always ready, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:01.94,1:41:04.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们需要一名中尉 想当吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hear they need a new lieutenant. Want the job?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:04.65,1:41:08.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的 等我阵亡你再换人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll take it, till I get killed or you find someone better.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:10.86,1:41:14.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全体人员报到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Attention. All personnel report to your stations.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:14.12,1:41:17.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 好吧 - 75分钟后降落{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Well... - Prepare for drop in 75 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:17.62,1:41:19.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要小心 强尼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take care of yourself,Johnny.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:19.50,1:41:21.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,后会有期{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll see you again.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:34.47,1:41:36.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,立正{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Officer on deck!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:53.57,1:41:57.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 这些孩子是谁? - 支援部队{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who are all these kids? - We got reinforced.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:57.24,1:41:59.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多半是菜鸟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Most of them are fresh out of boot.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:59.54,1:42:01.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们算是老兵{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're the old men, Ace.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:03.75,1:42:05.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,新兵听好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is for all you new people.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:06.09,1:42:08.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只有一个规则{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I only have one rule:
Dialogue: 0,1:42:08.42,1:42:11.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全力以赴 不能退缩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everyone fights. No one quits.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:11.59,1:42:14.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不尽力我就亲自宰了你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you don't do your job, I'll kill you myself.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:14.76,1:42:16.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明白吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you get me?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:16.14,1:42:18.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明白 长官{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We get you, sir!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:18.26,1:42:22.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 欢迎加入硬汉部队 - 瑞哥的硬汉部队{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Welcome to the Roughnecks. - Rico's Roughnecks!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:25.56,1:42:28.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天要进入虫穴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Today we're gonna pay a visit to Bug City.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:28.23,1:42:31.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找一只没见过的大虫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're lookin' for a bug no one's ever seen before.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:31.61,1:42:33.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一只聪明的虫子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some kind of smart bug.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:39.37,1:42:41.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它可能知道我们要去 来吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And it probably knows we're comin'.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:45.42,1:42:47.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快! 跑 跑 跑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on! Run, run, run, run, run!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:58.76,1:43:00.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快闪躲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Evasive action.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:24.08,1:43:25.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,准备进行超光速飞行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get us clear for warp, Number Two.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:25.96,1:43:28.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,五秒后 四...三...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clear in five, four...
Dialogue: 0,1:43:28.46,1:43:30.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 开始转换超光速引擎... - 三...五{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Initiating star drive... - three...in five.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:54.61,1:43:57.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杨罗杰号被击中 就快坠毁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Rodger Young. We're going down Repeat, this is Rodger Young.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:57.11,1:44:00.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 快离开这里 - 弃舰...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Get out! We're going down. - Abandon ship! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:01.95,1:44:04.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡门!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Carmen! Oh!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:04.12,1:44:06.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 山德! - 这!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Zander! - Here!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:06.96,1:44:10.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 快赶去逃生艇 - 来吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We've got to get to the rescue deck! - Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:26.64,1:44:27.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,舰长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:30.98,1:44:33.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快弃舰 这是命...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Abandon ship. That's an...
Dialogue: 0,1:44:35.32,1:44:37.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她死了 卡门 她死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's dead, Carmen. She's dead!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:55.26,1:44:58.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go! Here!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:13.52,1:45:14.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟我来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Follow me!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:26.62,1:45:27.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ready?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:53.23,1:45:56.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,B63逃生艇 两人在艇上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Life pod Bravo 6-3, two aboard.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:03.66,1:46:08.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,搜寻降落点 扫瞄地形 这儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Scanning for a landing zone! Checking terrain. Here!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:08.41,1:46:10.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你行吗? - 小意思{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Can you handle that? - Piece of cake.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:14.29,1:46:16.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我们失去了杨罗杰号 - 你们在什么位置?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We've lost the Rodger Young! - What is your position?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:16.92,1:46:20.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,经过确实 杨罗杰号坠毁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Flight Command, we have confirmation. The Rodger Young is down.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:20.59,1:46:22.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,强尼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh.Johnny!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:24.59,1:46:28.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,强尼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Johnny!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:28.26,1:46:30.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杨罗杰号遭击毁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rodger Young just burned up.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:30.31,1:46:33.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在救援{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's on the rescue net.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:33.77,1:46:36.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有没有生还者?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Any survivors?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:36.77,1:46:39.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,情况很糟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, they're getting tarred up there pretty bad.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:39.48,1:46:40.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,B63逃生艇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bravo 6-3, two aboard.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:40.94,1:46:42.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,收到吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is anyone receiving?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:42.61,1:46:43.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 有人收到吗? - 收到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Is anyone receiving? - Affirmative.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:44.07,1:46:45.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里是硬汉部队{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Roughneck 2-0.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:45.66,1:46:47.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,讯号中断 请重覆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're breaking up. Say again.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:47.28,1:46:49.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 卡门? - 请重复 信号中断{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Carmen? - Say again. I'm losing you.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:49.74,1:46:51.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡门!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Carmen!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:55.00,1:46:56.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,准备降落{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Prepare for landing.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:56.46,1:46:58.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,反向推动器 三...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Retros in three...
Dialogue: 0,1:46:58.38,1:47:00.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,二...一...启动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}two, one, fire!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:16.94,1:47:18.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡门 卡门{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Carmen. Carmen.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:18.82,1:47:20.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你没事吧? - 嗯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey, are you okay? - Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:21.07,1:47:22.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快下来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get out. Get out.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:32.12,1:47:36.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是硬汉部队 收到吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Roughneck 2-0. Are you receiving? Over. This is Roughneck 2-0.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:36.33,1:47:39.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 卡门 你收到吗? - 强尼 是你吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Carmen, are you receiving? - Johnny, is that you?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:39.88,1:47:42.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我 你的位置和状况如何?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's me! Wh, what's your position and situation?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:42.67,1:47:44.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们在虫穴 地下二十米{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're in Bug City, 20 metres underground.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:44.38,1:47:47.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,位置是...南42 东118{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Position: south 42, east 118.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:47.72,1:47:49.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,状况...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Situation is...
Dialogue: 0,1:47:49.85,1:47:51.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,重复 南42 东118{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I repeat. South 42, east 118.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:51.72,1:47:54.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,状况呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's your situation? Over.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:54.23,1:47:55.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡门{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Carmen.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:57.85,1:47:59.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,状况很危险{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Situation is extremely hostile.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:04.69,1:48:06.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快派小队救援{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need a squad to pull 'em out!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:06.74,1:48:08.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 方向? - 西南方三公里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Direction? - Three clicks, south by southwest.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:15.41,1:48:17.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look out!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:36.06,1:48:38.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 怎么办? - 大伙听到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What do you wanna do? - You heard the lieutenant.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:38.65,1:48:42.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救援队 第三班跟我来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rescue party! Third squad, come with me!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:43.07,1:48:45.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,取消命令{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cancel that!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:45.57,1:48:48.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们都知道她已经死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know as well as I do, she's already dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:51.74,1:48:53.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很遗憾 老兄{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:55.08,1:48:58.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,硬汉部队 前进{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Roughnecks, let's move.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:58.75,1:49:00.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:15.60,1:49:17.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它们为何不杀死我们?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why didn't they kill us?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:17.60,1:49:19.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它们要活捉我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They want us alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:13.74,1:50:16.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们应该走这边{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We should go this way.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:17.41,1:50:19.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,A连前往这方向{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A Company's that way.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:19.91,1:50:24.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错 可是卡门在这儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, but Carmen's down there.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:24.25,1:50:27.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恕我直言 老兄 她已经死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, I hate to be rude, buddy, but word has it she's dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:29.09,1:50:30.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她还活着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's still alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:30.42,1:50:32.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么知道?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do you know?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:32.76,1:50:35.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 别问我 我就是知道 - 听着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I don't know how I know, but I know. - Listen.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:35.55,1:50:37.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,指挥官违反命令的...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got command, but going off mission...
Dialogue: 0,1:50:38.06,1:50:40.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罪名很重{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's a serious offence.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:40.52,1:50:42.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你会被判吊刑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think they hang you for that.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:44.69,1:50:48.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,硬汉20部队继续前进{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Roughneck 2-0, proceed on mission.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:48.61,1:50:51.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要两名自愿者{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need two volunteers.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:02.06,1:52:03.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有一天{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One day...
Dialogue: 0,1:52:03.64,1:52:06.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像我这样的人...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}someone like me...
Dialogue: 0,1:52:06.14,1:52:07.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会消灭你们...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is gonna kill you...
Dialogue: 0,1:52:07.98,1:52:10.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,整个臭虫族{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and your whole fucking race.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:09.17,1:53:10.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道这是什么吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what this is?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:13.34,1:53:14.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你当然知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sure you do.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:16.26,1:53:18.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是肥大的聪明虫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're some kind of big, fat, smart bug...
Dialogue: 0,1:53:18.93,1:53:20.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:22.47,1:53:24.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:35.86,1:53:37.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是硬汉部队{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Roughneck 2-0.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:37.74,1:53:41.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虫族首脑往西五区前进{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Brain Bug sighted moving west of grid five.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:43.62,1:53:45.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快跑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Run!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:15.15,1:54:17.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快 快{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go! Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:17.69,1:54:21.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 核弹给我 - 你想当英雄吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Give me the nuke! - You trying to be a hero, Watkins?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:23.32,1:54:26.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想要除虫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm trying to kill some bugs, sir!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:26.79,1:54:29.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们快走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get outta here! Get outta here!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:31.50,1:54:32.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快走吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:37.50,1:54:40.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来啊 想死吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on! You like that? You like that? Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:40.84,1:54:42.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想死吗? 吃子弹吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want a little more?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:45.60,1:54:48.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想死吗? 吃子弹吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You like that? You like that? You like that? You like that? You want a little more?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:54.90,1:54:56.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来呀 来呀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:01.44,1:55:02.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, come on, come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:27.30,1:55:28.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧 卡门{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Carmen.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:40.82,1:55:43.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们成功了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We did it! We won!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:48.66,1:55:50.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 怎么回事? - 逮到它了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's going on? - They got it!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:50.99,1:55:52.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来呀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:35.46,1:56:37.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它在想什么 中校?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's it thinking, Colonel?
Dialogue: 0,1:56:55.77,1:56:57.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它很害怕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's afraid.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:58.53,1:56:59.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怕得要命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's afraid!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:03.91,1:57:07.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 快 - 好!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come on. - Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:07.37,1:57:09.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡尔! 卡尔!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Carl! Carl! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:09.79,1:57:12.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们还活着 很好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, look who's here. You made it. Good.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:12.79,1:57:16.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你教我的 是你教我去找卡门{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was you, wasn't it? You told me how to find Carmen.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:16.19,1:57:17.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是机密{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, that's classified.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:19.72,1:57:22.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们三个在一起就...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, whenever the three of us are together...
Dialogue: 0,1:57:22.55,1:57:25.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能无往不胜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I feel like things might just work out.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:25.56,1:57:27.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希望你说的对 卡门{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hope you're right, Carmen.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:27.56,1:57:30.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们逮到虫族首脑 很快就知道它们的弱点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've got one of their Brains now. Pretty soon we'll know how they think.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:30.56,1:57:33.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样一来就能击败它们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then we'll know how to beat them.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:33.23,1:57:35.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有一天战争会结束{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One day it will all be over...
Dialogue: 0,1:57:35.40,1:57:38.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家会忘记这场奋战的功臣{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and everyone will forget that this was the moment.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:38.40,1:57:41.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回想之时{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is when it turned.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:41.40,1:57:45.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是强大的舰队或是犀利的武器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And it wasn't the mighty Fleet, it wasn't some fancy new weapon.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:49.41,1:57:52.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而是逮到虫族首脑的辛姆教官{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was a drill instructor named Zim who captured a Brain.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:54.25,1:57:56.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 好 - 辛姆?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah! - Zim?
Dialogue: 0,1:58:00.22,1:58:02.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,辛姆逮到大虫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Zim. Zim got the bug.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:02.55,1:58:04.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,辛姆逮到大虫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Zim got the bug, man!
Dialogue: 0,1:58:04.22,1:58:07.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 干得好 中士 - 谢谢你 长官{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Good job, Sergeant. - Thank you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:07.60,1:58:12.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我是二等兵 - 继续 二等兵{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That would be private, sir. - Carry on, Private.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:12.52,1:58:15.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 是的 长官 - 好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yes, sir! - Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:58:19.57,1:58:22.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虫族首脑将透露什么秘密?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What mysteries will the Brain Bug reveal?
Dialogue: 0,1:58:22.74,1:58:27.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,科学家日以继夜 探索它的奥秘{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Federal scientists are working around the clock to probe its secrets.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:27.74,1:58:31.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一旦了解虫族就能消灭它们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Once we understand the bug, we will defeat it.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:37.42,1:58:38.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们有舰队{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have the ships.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:39.01,1:58:40.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们有武器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have the weapons.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:41.84,1:58:43.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们需要战士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need soldiers.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:43.93,1:58:46.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像丝黛克中尉这种战士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Soldiers like Lieutenant Stack Lumbrezer.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:46.26,1:58:48.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抵达目标区 舰长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're over the target area now, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:48.43,1:58:51.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 还有卡门·艾邦妮兹舰长 - 我是舰长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And Captain Carmen Ibanez. - This is the captain speaking.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:51.69,1:58:53.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,准备降落{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All personnel prepare for drop.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:53.44,1:58:56.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,二等兵利维和瑞哥中尉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Soldiers like Private Ace Levy and Lieutenant John Rico.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:56.27,1:58:59.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大兵们 拚命吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, you apes! You wanna live forever?
Dialogue: 0,1:58:59.86,1:59:01.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们需要你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need you all.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:01.40,1:59:04.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,服役就有公民权{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Service guarantees citizenship.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:11.46,1:59:14.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(继续奋战)
Dialogue: 0,1:59:15.60,1:59:18.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(胜利在望)
